      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/44d0fbeb749d7e4913d6b498dc66dcd2bbd5aded.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=8808c6289f6e4274a1d21b78fede344b"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf4f5bc7a29a330fc4d7a1e2810a9161f8ad2281.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=71fd913a8d23d975eb0fb3e993360170"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Excel-erate your output with Microsoft 365&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ready to woo your team with the sharpest Excel skills in the office? We’ve got you covered with an approachable bundle of ebooks on Excel and the greater Microsoft 365 suite! Jam‑packed with titles from the iconic &lt;em&gt;For Dummies&lt;/em&gt; series like &lt;em&gt;Microsoft 365 Excel Formulas &amp; Functions For Dummies, 7th Edition&lt;/em&gt; and &lt;em&gt;Excel Data Analysis For Dummies, 5th Edition&lt;/em&gt;, this amazing bundle by Wiley covers a wide range of beginner and intermediate topics to help meet you at your existing skill level. Experience Excel’s everyday power of simple data organization, powerful calculations, and more while helping to support Kiss the Ground when you learn with Humble Bundle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#excelworkbookfordummies"&gt;Excel Workbook For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#excelquickandeasy"&gt;Excel Quick and Easy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#excelportablegenius"&gt;Excel Portable Genius&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#teachyourselfvisuallymicrosoftteams"&gt;Teach Yourself VISUALLY Microsoft Teams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#teachyourselfvisuallymicrosoft365"&gt;Teach Yourself VISUALLY Microsoft 365&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftcopilotfordummies"&gt;Microsoft Copilot For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoft365portablegenius"&gt;Microsoft 365 Portable Genius&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoft365excelfordummies"&gt;Microsoft 365 Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#statisticalanalysiswithexcelfordummies"&gt;Statistical Analysis with Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gettinggreatresultswithexcelpivottablespowerqueryandpowerpivot"&gt;Getting Great Results with Excel Pivot Tables, PowerQuery and PowerPivot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#financialmodelinginexcelfordummies"&gt;Financial Modeling in Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#excelpowerpivotandpowerqueryfordummies"&gt;Excel Power Pivot &amp; Power Query For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datavisualizationwithexceldashboardsandreports"&gt;Data Visualization with Excel Dashboards and Reports&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftprojectfordummies"&gt;Microsoft Project For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoftpowerplatformfordummies"&gt;Microsoft Power Platform For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoft365excelformulasandfunctionsfordummies"&gt;Microsoft 365 Excel Formulas &amp; Functions For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#microsoft365accessfordummies"&gt;Microsoft 365 Access For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#exceldataanalysisfordummies"&gt;Excel Data Analysis For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#exceldashboardsandreportsfordummies"&gt;Excel Dashboards &amp; Reports For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="excelworkbookfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="excelworkbookfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/excelworkbookfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=71ecabe1c6476a01e4c18ab7683de0077805216ca381249b00c9858be0cd104c"&gt;Excel Workbook For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ec3dc59a0fca1c34ae3601cfe5e52ab150400ca8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4db3f7a989862cccdfb257a570293a14"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your step-by-step roadmap from Excel n00b to function masterKnowing your way around Excel can mean the difference between becoming a professional data analysis superhero and spending your days just getting the SUM function to work right for once. Excel Workbook For Dummies serves as teacher and curriculum on your journey to becoming a go-to Excelpert (Excel+expert, get it?). Start with the basics of creating spreadsheets and doing basic formatting before getting to know functions, graphics, and macros. Start TODAY to go from AVERAGE Excel user to a UNIQUE data crunching pro.Inside...    Enter data and format a sheet  Add financial formulas  Work with logic functions  Create, format, and edit charts  Secure your file and data  Build a pivot table  Write time-saving macros  Find 50 unique tips to help take charge of Excel&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="excelquickandeasy"&gt;&lt;a id="excelquickandeasy" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/excelquickandeasy_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=37e68adbb668cbd727ce6c85b557aebd057928ec2956287be7230e00d8c34a6e"&gt;Excel Quick and Easy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/a6e05fb52627cdfce5128f4c2b009f1c591b28c9.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1bd6c907cd5b4954509edfff1e85459a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Just the good essential parts of Excel!Based on the ever-popular Excel Bible, Excel Quick and Easy is a short handy reference to completing the most essential Excel spreadsheet tasks.Ideal for Excel users who need an on the go reference to take between home and office or from one client site to another. Also highly useful for people who have been using Excel forever and just cant remember all of those critical steps as well as new users good with Google sheets and other free apps finding tasks in Excel the first time.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="excelportablegenius"&gt;&lt;a id="excelportablegenius" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/excelportablegenius_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=ff73cec29cb18ea66cad65a4fbbe6892b5b87df6d5e586e493b743a54bdb0f7d"&gt;Excel Portable Genius&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e461bab487ea39b51198ba5e94cba7acbb12e5bf.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8385faf5984406a9a881ab0c4ebdf8f2"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excel Portable Genius contains practical advice and covers the key features of Microsoft Excel in a concise, fast-paced guide perfect for novice and experienced users. This guide features clearly worded instructions so that anyone can learn the capabilities available to them through Excel.  Whether you are experienced or novice, this guide will offer valuable information including how to:    Graph or chart data to assist users in identifying data trends  Format data to make important data easy to find and understand  Print data and charts for use in reports  Sort and filter data to find specific information  Link worksheet data and charts for use in other programs such as Microsoft PowerPoint and Word  Import data from database programs for analysis    A comprehensive index designed for easy navigation, concise instructions, and a small, portable size makes this the ideal guide for every user of the world's most popular spreadsheet program.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt10"&gt;Pay $10 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="teachyourselfvisuallymicrosoftteams"&gt;&lt;a id="teachyourselfvisuallymicrosoftteams" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/teachyourselfvisuallymicrosoftteams_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=fe6f28ee67932917fd343be07550521f78830e59a9c2e74a2c