;&lt;p&gt;Quickly and efficiently learn the latest version of Microsoft 365!  Are you a visual learner who wants to spend more time working in Microsoft 365 than trying to figure out how the programs actually work? Teach Yourself Visually Microsoft 365 offers you a straightforward, visual approach to making your work life more efficient and productive using the latest version of the Microsoft Office suite. Featuring visually rich tutorials and step-by-step instructions that will help you make the most of this power-packed suite of office productivity tools, it covers everything you need to compute, document, graph, chart, present, and organize your way to success in the workplace--from the most basic to the most advanced.  The Microsoft suite can be intimidating to the uninitiated, but it doesn't have to be. Through a series of easy-to-follow, full-color two-page tutorials, you'll quickly get up and running on working in Word, excelling at Excel, powering through PowerPoint, keeping in touch on Outlook, managing data in Access, and all while learning to make your tasks faster and easier with new Co-Pilot generative AI integration in your apps!    Highly visual tutorials and step-by-step screenshots make lessons easy to follow and understand  Helps you grasp the basic functions of Microsoft 365--and beyond  Walks you through Microsoft 365's new features  Demonstrates how to use the Microsoft suite to make your work life more streamlined and effective including up-to-date coverage of quick and easy content with Co-Pilot Generative AI  Whether you're looking to discover what's new in the latest release of Microsoft 365 or don't know Access from Word, this visual guide makes learning easy!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftcopilotfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftcopilotfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoftcopilotfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=667dff10b9bb3aafbc112e095f765d31c586597234a8077a4fba5606d5f55ff6"&gt;Microsoft Copilot For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e66dde21cfd1e46f428d60b253443d4bb81f2746.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9899899cad7df9e377c908e61bb2e504"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Have a safe AI landing with Microsoft Copilot  AI is unavoidable. AI tools are swiftly becoming part of the apps and tools we use daily, especially if you use Microsoft tools. This book navigates the world of Microsoft Copilot, the AI functionality assisting users of Office apps, Window, and even special AI-enhanced laptops. Discover how to write Copilot-friendly prompts, enhance output with integrated Copilot tools, and how to apply Copilot to specific tasks like project management.  Inside...    Prompting with text or voice  Working with a Copilot+ PC  Integrating Copilot with Office apps  Creating AI images  Customizing Copilot to your needs  Adding plug-ins to the service&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoft365portablegenius"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoft365portablegenius" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoft365portablegenius_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=050f338dc4bf43f5d8fa7ae6adee1909026faddfb0b123d507d271ccd401459d"&gt;Microsoft 365 Portable Genius&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6f94d5431d5d18cc9f39d6ffa04d818c739ff955.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=516bcad52287467ea1e69b33cd3cfb05"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Microsoft 365 Portable Genius contains practical advice and covers the key features of Microsoft 365 in a concise, fast-paced guide perfect for those new to Microsoft software. This full-color guide features clearly worded instructions as well as illustrations so that anyone may learn the ins and outs of Microsoft 365. Even experienced users can discover new tips and tricks to maximize their experience and eliminate hassles.  With organizations and businesses adopting Microsoft 365 as their medium for collaboration, now is the perfect time to learn the techniques that will allow you to benefit from all the services and applications available to users. Whether you are experienced or novice, this guide will offer valuable information including how to:    Manage your daily activities in one view with Outlook  Utilize a growing catalog of premium templates for Word, Excel, and PowerPoint, that include high-impact photos and 3D models  Back up and access photos and files on all your devices with 1 TB of OneDrive cloud storage  Access your files with the new Office mobile app for Android and iOS that combines Word, Excel, and PowerPoint into one single app    A comprehensive index designed for easy navigation, concise instructions, and a small, portable size makes this the ideal guide for Microsoft 365 users on the go.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoft365excelfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoft365excelfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoft365excelfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=a2845cce721e402a63c7cdd0170e5d95876dac4e296b765d3d2f8dc61923c4d5"&gt;Microsoft 365 Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7005838c2975d5f905fd78e135f3fca84139a352.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=426ffe5d894e0727709845bd94944161"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make Excel Work For You Microsoft Excel is an essential tool for anyone doing business. It's also an intimidating tool that can force a user to find complex ways to create a result that could be handled quickly with a little know-how. This book is the key to getting that know-how. Written by an Excel trainer who's conducted thousands of online and in-person training sessions on all things Excel, this book walks readers from the basics of creating a spreadsheet to getting into skills that will impress your colleagues or manager. You'll also see how to use Excel in your daily life, creating things like household budgets. Inside... -Creating your first spreadsheet-Dealing with multiple data entry points-Running basic calculations-Customizing the look of a spreadsheet-Building data visualizations-Pivoting to a pivot table-Applying lesser-known functions&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="statisticalanalysiswithexcelfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="statisticalanalysiswithexcelfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/statisticalanalysiswithexcelfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=c18f606d3621fd4a6f046a3f898167a9c75ba87f897ffcdac3db09ab917885b0"&gt;Statistical Analysis with Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e58fd0faad0d3bc66ad9814b4ce9ac2d87eee125.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9a41b41d09c6ac499a272cd2752b4bb5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Statistical Analysis with Excel For Dummies, 5th Edition&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gettinggreatresultswithexcelpivottablespowerqueryandpowerpivot"&gt;&lt;a id="gettinggreatresultswithexcelpivottablespowerqueryandpowerpivot" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/gettinggreatresultswithexcelpivottablespowerqueryandpowerpivot_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=de1b3f1feecc6bd6e1f2f82c28210e29059d2d31268a81849b37d4ed6c2eb87c"&gt;Getting Great Results with Excel Pivot Tables, PowerQuery and PowerPivot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6705029a96eb0ac20d96d0b1d29b35b9e33f75bc.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6b06e5c17fe457f5cc2a68a17078c516"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;There used to be a time when a companys IT team would manage all of the data and create the necessary charts and reports from that data, based on the users needs. But now, for most companies, those days are long gone!   In todays world, we are all overwhelmed by huge amounts of data from many different sources. And on top of that, our co-workers, bosses, vendors, and customers are asking us for all kinds of reports and charts from that data. They also want it to be flexible, so they can change the parameters, and have it produce instant results. Oh, and by the way, they needed it all yesterday! Sort it this way, filter it this way, show it month by month, etc. It is a daunting and time-consuming task, to say the least! Plus, you have all of the other responsibilities for your job as well.   Microsoft Excel has great tools to help you manage your data, and report on it the way you need to. Using Pivot Tables, PowerQuery, PowerPivot, you can pull in data from many sources, clean up and prepare your data, summarize your data in many ways, add to your data with formulas, create visually appealing and interactive dashboards and get real results from your data, all without having to be a programmer. This book will show how to use these tools in an easy-to-follow step by step format, backed up with screen prints and real-life examples.   Pivot Tables, the PowerQuery, and the PowerPivot are very powerful tools, and they can do a lot of different things. They are very popular in the marketplace. But people do not really know how to use them properly and are even intimated by them. There are videos and books that will show people how to use them, but many times the people who make the videos and books talk too technically or with too much jargon, so that these resources are not that helpful for most people out there.   The marketplace needs an easy-to-use guide that will allow them to get quick, meaningful results from their data, without having a degree in computing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="financialmodelinginexcelfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="financialmodelinginexcelfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/financialmodelinginexcelfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=a0ae3166d6c82e6ddaf16a1435e8f952beec7e30040549e4bf1f493f55b1e4d1"&gt;Financial Modeling in Excel For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/919d7f906f3db49c34ca8ccbee54bb8baae71a3a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=92554decef5ae5cfb7030ef7a695ddfd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A BUDGET SO BEAUTIFUL, IT COULD MODEL!      Financial Modeling in Excel For Dummies, 2nd Edition will help Excel users stay on budget, read financial reports in Excel, and build a forecast without needing to be a math wizard. This step-by-step guide is worth every dollar! Every company can benefit from financial modeling, whether your business is selling cookies from grandmas recipe, creating a company project for class, or working form the corner office downtown.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="excelpowerpivotandpowerqueryfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="excelpowerpivotandpowerqueryfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/excelpowerpivotandpowerqueryfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=3f7216078eec2aaf7e21346d8b55fc8bdc60babd6f143f501930779155bfdcef"&gt;Excel Power Pivot &amp; Power Query For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6b2fbddc84cde2d63c59734fcf5c53fcaccc40ad.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d93a3b2f8f6a75216c50793c114393ca"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excel Power Pivot &amp;amp; Power Query For Dummies, 2nd Edtion will give data professionals a foundation in the using Excel to transform their data. Use Power Query to get your data into Excel, and then enrich that data using Power Pivot. Integrate your data from multiple platforms, improve business intelligence, and analyze at a higher level when you follow the step-by-step guides in this book. Excel enables professionals to save time and increase efficiency. Trust Dummies to help you reach your full data potential!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datavisualizationwithexceldashboardsandreports"&gt;&lt;a id="datavisualizationwithexceldashboardsandreports" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/datavisualizationwithexceldashboardsandreports_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=2760005d575c760c2e9306f1fea364aa31985851c9834b7ab7e67df811a26e2b"&gt;Data Visualization with Excel Dashboards and Reports&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b6e15ba1a1c08ff8810f8f92f4177973e0a2d51e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=00b0329dca12219dd3ad2522b7859960"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Large corporations like IBM and Oracle are using Excel dashboards and reports as a Business Intelligence tool, and many other smaller businesses are looking to these tools in order to cut costs for budgetary reasons. An effective analyst not only has to have the technical skills to use Excel in a productive manner but must be able to synthesize data into a story, and then present that story in the most impactful way. Microsoft shows its recognition of this with Excel.  In Excel, there is a major focus on business intelligence and visualization.  Data Visualization with Excel Dashboards and Reports fills the gap between handling data and synthesizing data into meaningful reports.  This title will show readers how to think about their data in ways other than columns and rows.  Most Excel books do a nice job discussing the individual functions and tools that can be used to create an "Excel Report".  Titles on Excel charts, Excel pivot tables, and other books that focus on "Tips and Tricks" are useful in their own right; however they don't hit the mark for most data analysts.  The primary reason these titles miss the mark is they are too focused on the mechanical aspects of building a chart, creating a pivot table, or other functionality.  They don't offer these topics in the broader picture by showing how to present and report data in the most effective way.  What are the most meaningful ways to show trending?  How do you show relationships in data?  When is showing variances more valuable than showing actual data values?   How do you deal with outliers?  How do you bucket data in the most meaningful way?  How do you show impossible amounts of data without inundating your audience?  In Data Visualization with Excel Reports and Dashboards, readers will get answers to all of these questions. Part technical manual, part analytical guidebook, this title will help Excel users go from reporting data with simple tables full of dull numbers, to creating high-impact reports and dashboards that will wow management both visually and substantively. This book offers a comprehensive review of a wide array of technical and analytical concepts that will help users create meaningful reports and dashboards.  After reading this book, the reader will be able to:    Analyze large amounts of data and report their data in a meaningful way  Get better visibility into data from different perspectives  Quickly slice data into various views on the fly  Automate redundant reporting and analyses  Create impressive dashboards and What-If analyses  Understand the fundamentals of effective visualization  Visualize performance comparisons  Visualize changes and trends over time&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftprojectfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftprojectfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoftprojectfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=70795bc9ae75d10a926a938245d3dfff0e3c966e6744666aea2bfead0d45919f"&gt;Microsoft Project For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bd780b4532ae32226bc6dfd6269427c71b92aa0c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=256050990bdf94b20a7bdb49c3830fde"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;DUMMIES KNOWS YOU CAN MANAGE IT     Microsoft Project For Dummies will guide Microsoft Project users through the steps of getting set up, started, and finding success with this project management program. Experience with the traditional suite of Office products like Word and Excel, but need to branch out for higher productivity and increased efficiency? Dummies can show you how, with Microsoft Project For Dummies! Learn how to use the 2021 version of Microsoft Project from the reference book that will never leave your desk.      INSIDE:     Getting set up and started  How to connect Microsoft Project with other Office products  Setting and sorting tasks  Making modifications  Applying and creating filters  Estimating time  Working with calendars&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftpowerplatformfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftpowerplatformfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoftpowerplatformfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=095c09c371d59f31f38119fbaea5072ea08b2a66bc73558a7d32d69fef3867d6"&gt;Microsoft Power Platform For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/80c1d31b04ece6e1b376a7ebc2956bbb2ce79769.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6f662e8f77c358ff0e5ef7f707133563"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build intelligence on Power Platform   Microsoft Power Platform provides business intelligence tools to over 20 million users. This book is your one stop resource for building your own intelligence around these important tools. Get a handle on how to manage and report data with Power BI, build no-code apps with Power Apps, create simple web properties with Power Pages, and simplify your day-to-day work with Power Automate. Written by a business consultant who's helped some of the worlds largest organizations adopt, manage, and get work done with Power Platform, this book gets you through your work the fun and easy way.   Inside...    What Power Platform is and what it does  Data management with Power BI  Simple app creation with Power Apps  Tips for automating work with Power Automate  Quick web page creation with Power Pages  Insight into best practices for launching Power Platform in an organization&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoft365excelformulasandfunctionsfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoft365excelformulasandfunctionsfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoft365excelformulasandfunctionsfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=4310adfaea045e795205c12f8ee5ce80294819352ae2016d6bd3fe3114c852be"&gt;Microsoft 365 Excel Formulas &amp; Functions For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/174375bcb6f9c6ebf9fd3918f3cfbf44c78aa2ec.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c50ac5a5be7a5af3783da7a781b51bdf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Use Excels built-in features to your advantage.  With Excel Formulas ll know exactly how to navigate the popular spreadsheet editors more than 470 built-in functions in a way that best suits you and your projects needs. From learning all about formatting to utilizing key formulas and functions to help you save time and produce accurate and useful results, youll be getting the data you need in no time. Plus, inside youll find the latest on Copilot--Microsofts new AI component. Excel Formulas &amp;amp; Functions For Dummies, 7th Edition is your stress-free and reliable Excel guide!  Inside:    Creating and using formulas and functions  Tips for correcting formula errors  Using excel for math calculation  Analyzing data and calculating statistics  Working with dates and time  Navigating your data easily  Using new AI functionality with Copilot&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoft365accessfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoft365accessfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/microsoft365accessfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=2ba35837dda769796813207c7e1c4394eff8e250bb52a49e5747c5e1b82c5540"&gt;Microsoft 365 Access For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f0b4abbd4ed6925d2f967792b92f8bf238978724.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c03b65b17bd6e0d4f804de694819f820"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a useful database and get the answers you need with Dummies!  Access For Dummies, 2nd Edition clearly walks you through Microsofts database software, Access. Whether you have Microsoft 365 or Office 2021, inside youll find a plethora of tips, tricks, and best practices on creating and maintaining your database. Plus, discover all the ways in which you can utilize key features to customize and search within your database, ensuring you obtain the necessary data and reports with ease.  Updates include:    Edge browser controls in forms&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="exceldataanalysisfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="exceldataanalysisfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/exceldataanalysisfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=daf4031c4dfb791ca5eaad96dc85af8a9401fb8402129e4df4047d8dea252bff"&gt;Excel Data Analysis For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/db6339080d7e656ca68e04aea1b7a95a2de4af30.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=82f9bdad385811f4c782355d89b00859"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;EXCEL-LENT DATA ANALYSIS  Excel Data Analysis For Dummies, 5th Edition is the book Excel users need to improve their data analysis skills in Excel. Step-by-step guides make analyzing your data simple. Dont take a chance on inaccurate data---keep everything in line with the most popular spreadsheet application on the market.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="exceldashboardsandreportsfordummies"&gt;&lt;a id="exceldashboardsandreportsfordummies" href="https://cdn.humble.com/humblebundle/ops/pdfs/exceldashboardsandreportsfordummies_preview.pdf?t=st=1793473850~exp=1793560250~hmac=31817ea73456ac0e6aef02c0b2dcc41621704be896a2c7c1f32c03bc633a3767"&gt;Excel Dashboards &amp; Reports For Dummies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d61563857675a59f3b89b8314e83ca9507901436.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e950c99601f087ad5b214b3822b0b419"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Excel Dashboards  key questions about their data. With the help of dashboards and reports, data doesnt have to be endless rows and columns of numbers. Learn to make data understandable and valuable. This step-by-step guide helps Excel users take their knowledge beyond the basics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
