      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/27ed2959d2c281e7a2b0bc3e624eb26ecfd17094.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=55ab7784cef5292d566e5a7f460923c4"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6caf98992d6c5584664a7fbc0bec930f5e9bc79a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=7e72c17d41c003364c41b5004e3a83d9"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Master a time-honored craft!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Embrace an analog lifestyle and learn a new skill with this bundle of woodworking how-to guides from Taunton Press! Learn the woodworking basics that will bring your wood-based ideas to life, whether it’s a new piece of furniture, a beautiful cabinet, or a set of expertly turned chair legs, with &lt;em&gt;The Why &amp; How of Woodworking: A Simple Approach to Making Meaningful Work&lt;/em&gt;! Build the perfect box with &lt;em&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Box Making&lt;/em&gt;! Turn your kitchen into the galley of your dreams with &lt;em&gt;Bookcases, Cabinets &amp; Built-Ins&lt;/em&gt;! Use your new skills to build whatever your home, office, or studio requires, and support BINC with your purchase of this bundle at the price of you choosing!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#smartworkshopsolutions_buildingworkstationsjigsandaccesstoimprovey"&gt;Smart Workshop Solutions: Building Workstations, Jigs &amp; Access to Improve Your Shop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#handplanebook"&gt;The Handplane Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetowoodworking_finishingandsharpeni"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Woodworking: Finishing/Sharpening/Using Woodworking Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gettingstartedinwoodworking_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasi"&gt;Getting Started in Woodworking: Skill-Building Projects that Teach the Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#woodworking101_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasics"&gt;Woodworking 101: Skill-Building Projects that Teach the Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#whyandhowofwoodworking_asimpleapproachtomakingmeaningfulwork"&gt;The Why &amp; How of Woodworking: A Simple Approach to Making Meaningful Work&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#woodworkingbasics_masteringtheessentialsofcraftsmanship"&gt;Woodworking Basics: Mastering the Essentials of Craftsmanship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoboxmaking"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Box Making&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#built-ins_designcabinetsshelvesentertainmentcenters"&gt;Built-Ins: Design, Cabinets, Shelves, Entertainment Centers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bookcasescabinetsandbuilt-ins"&gt;Bookcases, Cabinets &amp; Built-Ins&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoturning_richardraffansultimategu"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Turning: Richard Raffan's Ultimate Guide: A Foundational Course for the Beginning and Experienced Turner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completeillustratedguidetofurnitureandcabinetconstruction_1000plus"&gt;The Complete Illustrated Guide to Furniture &amp; Cabinet Construction: 1,000+ Step-by-Step Photos and Diagrams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#routersandroutertables"&gt;Routers &amp; Router Tables&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#basicboxmaking"&gt;Basic Box Making&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#woodcarvingbasics"&gt;Wood Carving Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#workbench_acompleteguidetocreatingyourperfectbench"&gt;The Workbench: A Complete Guide to Creating Your Perfect Bench&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetotablesaws"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Tablesaws&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#turningwoodwithrichardraffan_updatedandexpandededition"&gt;Turning Wood with Richard Raffan: Updated and Expanded Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="smartworkshopsolutions_buildingworkstationsjigsandaccesstoimprovey"&gt;&lt;a id="smartworkshopsolutions_buildingworkstationsjigsandaccesstoimprovey"&gt;Smart Workshop Solutions: Building Workstations, Jigs &amp; Access to Improve Your Shop&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b9516deb56b89b8ba1ced10db61a0b1bb221eaad.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84119d69c96769e430bc237428805e4e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Smart Workshop Solutions&lt;/i&gt; is a must-have guide for DIY enthusiasts, woodworkers, and hobbyists looking to create a highly efficient, organized, and functional workspace.&lt;/b&gt;   This book covers everything from designing custom workstations to building innovative jigs that will save you time, improve precision, and increase productivity.   With clear, step-by-step instructions and expert tips, &lt;i&gt;Smart Workshop Solutions&lt;/i&gt; helps you optimize your workshop for a smoother, more enjoyable building experience. Whether you’re setting up a home workshop or upgrading an existing one, this book provides the tools and techniques you need to work smarter, not harder. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="handplanebook"&gt;&lt;a id="handplanebook"&gt;The Handplane Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/273903ebb47f61e1853a0a7b8caee3b6d23d9e07.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4b815c31b6a4b6c193ff1065a369799e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Master the art of handplanes—history, technique, and craftsmanship in one essential guide.&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;i&gt;The Handplane Book&lt;/i&gt; by Garrett Hack is a richly illustrated tribute to one of woodworking’s most iconic tools. Published by Taunton Press, this comprehensive guide covers everything from selecting and tuning handplanes to mastering their use in fine furniture making. Hack blends practical instruction with historical insight, tracing the evolution of handplanes from Roman times through the golden age of 19th-century toolmaking. With profiles of specialty planes, advice on buying vintage and modern models, and tips for planing technique, this book is both a workshop manual and a collector’s reference. Whether you're a seasoned woodworker or a curious beginner, &lt;i&gt;The Handplane Book&lt;/i&gt; invites you to reclaim the romance and precision of traditional craftsmanship. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetowoodworking_finishingandsharpeni"&gt;&lt;a id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetowoodworking_finishingandsharpeni"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Woodworking: Finishing/Sharpening/Using Woodworking Tools&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f8b619cb0d6f7b32109c0926cc1faa894172add6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=397a5e62aebfa9eb5391615ac331b902"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Woodworking&lt;/i&gt; is the ultimate reference for woodworkers of all skill levels seeking a comprehensive, visual, and practical guide to the craft.&lt;/b&gt;   Covering every essential aspect of woodworking—from selecting wood and mastering tools to crafting joints, shaping, finishing, and assembling—this all-in-one volume is packed with over 1,200 detailed illustrations, step-by-step instructions, and expert advice.   Whether you’re building furniture, cabinetry, or decorative projects, this guide provides the foundational skills and advanced techniques needed to work confidently and precisely. Perfect for both beginners and experienced woodworkers looking to deepen their understanding of the craft.&lt;h3 id="gettingstartedinwoodworking_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasi"&gt;&lt;a id="gettingstartedinwoodworking_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasi"&gt;Getting Started in Woodworking: Skill-Building Projects that Teach the Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/7ad9d92e29aec93049a304a03f60b662b07750e8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7eee48a139f0395dca1192d21798d297"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Build confidence, skill, and satisfaction—one project at a time.&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;i&gt;Getting Started in Woodworking: Skill-Building Projects That Teach the Basics&lt;/i&gt; by Aimé Ontario Fraser is the perfect launchpad for anyone new to the craft. This Taunton Press guide features a series of progressively challenging projects—from simple step stools to elegant lamps and bookcases—each designed to teach essential woodworking techniques while producing something useful and beautiful. With clear instructions, friendly encouragement, and practical advice, Fraser helps beginners navigate tools, materials, and shop setup with ease. The book’s approachable tone and stylish project designs make it especially appealing to those who want to build skills while creating furniture they’ll be proud to use or gift. Whether you're starting from scratch or brushing up rusty skills, this guide turns learning into doing—and doing into mastery. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodworking101_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasics"&gt;&lt;a id="woodworking101_skill-buildingprojectsthatteachthebasics"&gt;Woodworking 101: Skill-Building Projects that Teach the Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d74612dd12fbbd675f7858752ae2f8682d28ee1c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=95af24b23315142ac265ca45b6d9248c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Build confidence with every cut, joint, and project—no experience required.&lt;/b&gt;   If you’ve ever wanted to learn woodworking but didn’t know where to start, this book is your perfect entry point. &lt;i&gt;Woodworking 101&lt;/i&gt; gathers the best of Taunton’s acclaimed &lt;i&gt;Getting Started in Woodworking&lt;/i&gt; series into one comprehensive, easy-to-follow guide.   Designed specifically for beginners, it walks you through essential skills while guiding you through a series of rewarding, skill-building projects.  &lt;b&gt;Inside, you’ll find:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt; Step-by-step instructions for foundational techniques like measuring, cutting, joining, and finishing &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Clear photos, exploded diagrams, and shop schematics that make every process easy to understand &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt; Projects that grow with your skills—from simple shop helpers to furniture you’ll be proud to use and display &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;  Whether you're setting up your first workshop or just want to get more comfortable with tools and materials, this book helps you build both projects and confidence.   With expert guidance from seasoned woodworkers Joe Hurst-Wajszczuk, Aimé Fraser, and Matthew Teague, &lt;i&gt;Woodworking 101&lt;/i&gt; is more than a how-to—it’s a hands-on apprenticeship in print.&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="whyandhowofwoodworking_asimpleapproachtomakingmeaningfulwork"&gt;&lt;a id="whyandhowofwoodworking_asimpleapproachtomakingmeaningfulwork"&gt;The Why &amp; How of Woodworking: A Simple Approach to Making Meaningful Work&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8bf90cb429749e46d1198fb575f28aba67d2f2e5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=68281ec4f2b3484be95718911b765373"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Michael Pekovich's &lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Why &amp;amp; How of Woodworking&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt; is a time-tested must-have resource for anyone looking to create meaningful and lasting pieces, blending practical techniques with a deep appreciation for the craft.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you’re a beginner or an experienced woodworker, &lt;i&gt;The Why &amp;amp; How of Woodworking&lt;/i&gt; offers a blend of inspiration and practical advice that will elevate your craft and help you create pieces that are both beautiful and meaningful.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This bestselling book reflects the growing appreciation for the handmade, a movement toward simplifying, and the joy of creating lasting pieces. It's the ultimate guide for the modern DIYer and maker, offering a philosophy that elevates the craft from a hobby to a rewarding life skill.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Instagram sensation Michael Pekovich explains how to make work that is worth the time and effort it takes to make it—work that will add to the quality of our lives. By mastering the fundamentals in this book, you will not only create beautiful items but also gain the skills to save significant money on furniture and even start generating income from your own custom pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn the basics of woodworking, from choosing lumber with care, cutting joinery accurately, and preparing and finishing the surfaces. This simple approach guides you through designing and building cabinets, boxes, chests, casework, and tables—all built to last a lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;i&gt;The Why &amp;amp; How of Woodworking&lt;/i&gt; is the essential roadmap for anyone looking to fill their life with meaningful, useful objects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comprehensive Guidance&lt;/b&gt;: Learn the essentials of woodworking, from selecting the right lumber and mastering joinery to finishing surfaces with precision.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Timeless Projects&lt;/b&gt;: Discover a variety of projects, including cabinets, boxes, chests, casework, and tables, all designed to stand the test of time.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspirational Approach&lt;/b&gt;: Embrace a philosophy that values simplicity and functionality, encouraging you to create pieces that enrich your life and environment.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expert Insights&lt;/b&gt;: Benefit from the wisdom of Michael Pekovich, a seasoned furniture maker and creative director at &lt;i&gt;Fine Woodworking&lt;/i&gt;, who shares his approach to both woodworking and life.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Beautifully Illustrated&lt;/b&gt;: Enjoy stunning photography and detailed illustrations that bring each project to life, making it easy to follow along and achieve professional results.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodworkingbasics_masteringtheessentialsofcraftsmanship"&gt;&lt;a id="woodworkingbasics_masteringtheessentialsofcraftsmanship"&gt;Woodworking Basics: Mastering the Essentials of Craftsmanship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b7482d2601505f409aae310640a67e92287cd978.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3b56ac856096b1b67eee15bfa2c06224"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;With &lt;i&gt;Woodworking Basics: Mastering the Essentials of Craftsmanship,&lt;/i&gt; renowned instructor Peter Korn presents a comprehensive approach that has successfully guided hundreds of aspiring woodworkers through the fundamentals of the craft .&lt;/b&gt;   This book is your ultimate resource for building a solid foundation in woodworking, whether you’re a beginner or looking to refine your skills.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Proven Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Korn’s integrated approach emphasizes the right techniques from the very start, ensuring that you develop essential skills crucial to fine craftsmanship. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step-by-Step Instructions:&lt;/b&gt; Each chapter offers clear, detailed instructions, taking you through the safe use of machinery and the correct handling of hand tools. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Joinery Skills:&lt;/b&gt; Master classic woodworking joints such as mortise-and-tenon and dovetails, essential for creating sturdy, beautiful furniture &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hands-On Projects:&lt;/b&gt; Practice your newfound skills with two attractive and functional projects—a small bench and a side table with a door and drawer. These projects are designed to help you gain confidence in using both hand and power tools while producing functional pieces you can be proud of. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comprehensive Coverage:&lt;/b&gt; From milling a board four-square to cutting intricate joints, &lt;i&gt;Woodworking Basics&lt;/i&gt; covers all aspects of woodworking. Korn’s easy-to-follow approach, complemented by illustrations and tips, makes learning enjoyable and effective. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Perfect for All Skill Levels:&lt;/b&gt; Whether you’re just starting or looking to polish your craftsmanship, this book is an invaluable guide that will enhance your woodworking journey and inspire you to create beautiful pieces. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoboxmaking"&gt;&lt;a id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoboxmaking"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Box Making&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b5c6458e08f9c4355d33e4ea2c5e4006fed36d49.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=32014b8042a9ccddee0e23ca89a7e4ef"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;This comprehensive resource is the ultimate companion for mastering diverse box-making techniques, perfect for both beginners and experienced woodworkers.&lt;/b&gt;   Unlock the art of craftsmanship and transform your ideas into exquisite wooden treasures with &lt;i&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Box Making &lt;/i&gt;by esteemed professional woodworker Doug Stowe.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comprehensive Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Explore a wide range of box-making methods, ensuring you have the skills needed to create stunning, functional boxes tailored to your personal style. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Detailed Material Overviews:&lt;/b&gt; Gain insights into selecting the best materials, hardware, and tools for your projects, setting you up for success in every creation. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step-by-Step Guidance:&lt;/b&gt; Learn about various woodworking joints with clear, step-by-step instructions that help you build confidence and expertise in your craft. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual Inspiration:&lt;/b&gt; With over 500 vibrant color photographs, this guide offers a clear and engaging approach to woodworking, making it an essential addition to your library. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Bonus Resource:&lt;/b&gt; This book is a valuable companion to Stowe's DVD, &lt;i&gt;Basic Box Making&lt;/i&gt;, enhancing your learning experience and practical skills. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="built-ins_designcabinetsshelvesentertainmentcenters"&gt;&lt;a id="built-ins_designcabinetsshelvesentertainmentcenters"&gt;Built-Ins: Design, Cabinets, Shelves, Entertainment Centers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b64c5d3066b70abd3a260a1b479e85329d4521e7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=42efb9b2168d145b2fbc004ed92783b0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Transform your home with the timeless elegance and functionality of built-ins! &lt;i&gt;Built-Ins: Expert Advice from Start to Finish&lt;/i&gt; is the ultimate guide for anyone from novice woodworkers to master craftsmen.&lt;/b&gt;   This comprehensive book offers a unique perspective on creating built-in furniture that fits your space seamlessly, from strategic planning to tackling the challenges of idiosyncratic areas.   As the latest addition to the successful Build Like a Pro series, this 192-page volume features insights and expert guidance from veteran how-to author Bob Settich. You’ll find all the tools, tips, and techniques you need to take on various projects, including shelves, drawers, closets, and entertainment centers. This book will empower you to add permanent value to your home by creating attractive storage solutions while eliminating clutter.   By employing a practical, step-by-step approach to every project and procedure, this invaluable reference will equip you with everything you need to design, plan, and construct built-ins that enhance the beauty and functionality of any home.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Smart Planning:&lt;/b&gt; Learn how to design built-ins that achieve their intended function and perfectly fit the spaces where they're installed. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Problem-Solving Strategies:&lt;/b&gt; Get practical advice for overcoming common challenges like out-of-plumb walls and uneven floors, particularly in older homes. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Custom Solutions:&lt;/b&gt; Discover innovative ways to use stock cabinetry to create a custom-built look without the need to start from scratch.  &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="bookcasescabinetsandbuilt-ins"&gt;&lt;a id="bookcasescabinetsandbuilt-ins"&gt;Bookcases, Cabinets &amp; Built-Ins&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1f308c5a12796d20fe27a91eef6a1d33dcd3da3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=84a02f8a706a79b69c0a74d5d6638b9f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Storage solutions are a universal need, and this expert guide from &lt;i&gt;Fine Homebuilding &lt;/i&gt;and &lt;i&gt;Fine Woodworking&lt;/i&gt; will show you how to build custom units that are both sturdy and beautiful.&lt;/b&gt;  &lt;i&gt;Bookcases, Cabinets &amp;amp; Built-Ins&lt;/i&gt; is a collection of 25 step-by-step articles that help carpenters, woodworkers, and DIY enthusiasts of all skill levels create elegant storage pieces for any room.   Whether you’re organizing books, kitchen essentials, or sports gear, this book offers timeless designs and practical solutions to keep your life organized.  &lt;i&gt;Bookcases, Cabinets &amp;amp; Built-Ins&lt;/i&gt; provides both the seasoned carpenter and the DIY hobbyist with he inspiration and know-how to build beautiful, functional storage units that enhance your home. Perfect for anyone looking to maximize space and add a personal touch to their living areas.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;25 Projects:&lt;/b&gt; Includes detailed instructions for building a wide range of bookcases, built-ins, kitchen cabinets, and more. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expert Craftsmanship:&lt;/b&gt; Learn from some of America's most skilled woodworkers and craftsmen, offering advice on every aspect of design and construction. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Custom Solutions:&lt;/b&gt; From entertainment centers to mudroom organizers, these projects combine practicality with beautiful craftsmanship. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step-by-Step Instructions:&lt;/b&gt; Each project is clearly explained with helpful photos, illustrations, and pro tips &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoturning_richardraffansultimategu"&gt;&lt;a id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetoturning_richardraffansultimategu"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Turning: Richard Raffan's Ultimate Guide: A Foundational Course for the Beginning and Experienced Turner&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/82a105290ef205dd9a2a5bbc3f6d62b5f1f7e52f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=4120c1a4a10de1f194466bf3f596566f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Unlock your creativity with &lt;i&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Turning&lt;/i&gt;, an essential resource for woodturners of all skill levels.&lt;/b&gt;   Renowned expert Richard Raffan brings his wealth of knowledge to this comprehensive guide, featuring clear, step-by-step instructions and over 900 vibrant color photos that illuminate the art of turning wood.   Whether you're creating functional pieces or artistic sculptures, &lt;i&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Turning&lt;/i&gt; equips you with the knowledge and confidence to tackle any wood turning project. Elevate your skills, explore your creativity, and enjoy the rewarding journey of turning wood with this definitive guide.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comprehensive Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Dive into a wide range of wood turning techniques, including both spindle and faceplate methods. Raffan’s detailed explanations will guide you through every step, ensuring you gain a solid foundation in the craft. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Hands-On Instructions:&lt;/b&gt; Each technique is accompanied by hands-on instructions, making it easy for you to follow along and implement what you learn. Whether you’re a beginner or looking to refine your skills, this guide is your go-to resource. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Essential Tools &amp;amp; Equipment:&lt;/b&gt; Learn about the essential tools needed for wood turning, including lathes, turning tools, and chucks. Discover the best practices for using and maintaining these tools to achieve optimal results in your projects. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sharpening Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Understanding how to sharpen your tools is crucial for successful wood turning. This guide offers expert advice on sharpening techniques to keep your tools in top condition, ensuring clean and precise cuts. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual Learning:&lt;/b&gt; With over 900 color photographs, this guide provides a visual roadmap to help you grasp complex techniques and enhance your understanding of the turning process. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="completeillustratedguidetofurnitureandcabinetconstruction_1000plus"&gt;&lt;a id="completeillustratedguidetofurnitureandcabinetconstruction_1000plus"&gt;The Complete Illustrated Guide to Furniture &amp; Cabinet Construction: 1,000+ Step-by-Step Photos and Diagrams&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/45441510317a6e1ab6510631aaa4815d53b2f126.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6817f442cb18a76ecd004d2de75dea90"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Whether you're taking on your first cabinet or a seasoned craftsperson seeking a comprehensive shop reference, &lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Complete Illustrated Guide to Furniture &amp;amp; Cabinet Construction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt; by master woodworker Andy Rae is your essential guide.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This highly visual book breaks down the complex art of furniture making into clear, manageable components, empowering you to build beautiful, functional pieces that last a lifetime.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With detailed illustrated explanations of various techniques, you'll learn how to select the best methods for each project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Whether you're a beginner or an experienced woodworker, this guide provides the tools and knowledge needed to craft stunning furniture pieces that will last for generations.   &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Reference Quality:&lt;/b&gt; Written by acclaimed woodworker and former editor of &lt;i&gt;American Woodworker &lt;/i&gt;Andy Rae, this book is widely regarded as a definitive resource.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step-by-Step Visuals:&lt;/b&gt; Benefit from a graphic, step-by-step presentation of key techniques and methods, making even complex concepts easy to understand and replicate.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Component Breakdown:&lt;/b&gt; Explore the construction of boxes, cases, doors, drawers, shelves, and feet in detail. Learn the essential techniques used to build each part, enabling you to choose the best method for your specific project.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Assembly Mastery:&lt;/b&gt; Discover how to effectively combine individual components to create stunning finished pieces, from simple storage to complex furniture.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Techniques and Tips&lt;/b&gt;: Discover a variety of woodworking techniques and expert advice to elevate your skills and projects.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Material Knowledge&lt;/b&gt;: Gain insights into different woodworking materials and their applications for informed decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Design Principles&lt;/b&gt;: Learn essential design principles that enhance the functionality and aesthetics of your furniture creations.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Illustrated Guidance&lt;/b&gt;: Benefit from clear illustrations that complement the text, making complex concepts easy to grasp.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="routersandroutertables"&gt;&lt;a id="routersandroutertables"&gt;Routers &amp; Router Tables&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/94e92fd255debaa2328771abfd522e6dafb29a3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=1c68d1af72ca01e2e857c556e5d6e1b3"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Elevate your woodworking skills with &lt;i&gt;Routers &amp;amp; Router Tables&lt;/i&gt;, a comprehensive guide that dives deep into the world of routers and router tables—the essential tools for every woodworking enthusiast.&lt;/b&gt;   Renowned as the most versatile power tool in any workshop, routers are capable of shaping profiles, creating duplicate copies, flush-trimming edges, and cutting virtually every joint needed to build exquisite cabinets and furniture.   Transform your woodworking with the essential guide to routers and router tables, ensuring that you’re equipped to accomplish your best work yet. &lt;i&gt;Routers &amp;amp; Router Tables&lt;/i&gt; is your roadmap to mastering these powerful tools.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expert Insights:&lt;/b&gt; This all-new collection features 20 meticulously curated articles from America’s premier woodworking magazine, &lt;i&gt;Fine Woodworking&lt;/i&gt;, providing the latest information on routers and router tables, bits, jigs, and techniques. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Precision and Versatility:&lt;/b&gt; Discover how to enhance your woodworking projects with precision and ease. Learn the ins and outs of router joinery, and explore tips and tricks that will elevate your craftsmanship to new heights. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Practical Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Whether you’re looking to save space, improve versatility, or achieve unparalleled accuracy, this guide offers the smartest strategies for utilizing routers and router tables effectively in your shop. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;All-Inclusive Resource:&lt;/b&gt; This book serves as an invaluable reference, making it suitable for woodworkers of all skill levels. Whether you’re a novice or an experienced craftsman, you’ll find the information you need to tackle any project confidently. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Inspiration and Creativity:&lt;/b&gt; With insights from top woodworking professionals, you’ll be inspired to explore new techniques and projects, expanding your creative possibilities in the shop. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="basicboxmaking"&gt;&lt;a id="basicboxmaking"&gt;Basic Box Making&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/ab3713b4a252380284a185caadaf613e51e9f20c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0487d7d10ac39aed74356b172ad3bbc5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;With decades of experience, Doug Stowe shares his profound knowledge and passion for the craft of box making with &lt;i&gt;Basic Box Making.&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/b&gt;   Stowe guides you through the fundamental techniques to create stunning and functional boxes, from simple projects to more intricate designs.  &lt;i&gt;Basic Box Making&lt;/i&gt; is perfect for woodworkers of all skill levels, providing a solid foundation for anyone looking to delve into this rewarding craft. With Doug Stowe’s guidance, you’ll embark on an exciting journey of discovery and creativity, transforming simple materials into beautiful, handcrafted treasures.  &lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Step-by-Step Guidance&lt;/b&gt;: This comprehensive book provides clear, detailed instructions for a variety of box projects, enabling you to build your skills progressively. Each project is thoughtfully arranged by difficulty level, ensuring that you can tackle them at your own pace. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Skill Development&lt;/b&gt;: As you work through each project, you will not only hone your box-making techniques but also develop your creativity. Stowe emphasizes the importance of repetition, as practicing these techniques leads to refinement and success. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Encouraging Creativity&lt;/b&gt;: The book encourages you to explore your imagination and consider different design possibilities. With thought-provoking questions like “What if this box were made in that wood?” you’ll be inspired to innovate and personalize your creations. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Variety of Techniques&lt;/b&gt;: From basic joints to advanced finishes, this book covers everything you need to know to produce high-quality boxes that showcase your craftsmanship and style. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="woodcarvingbasics"&gt;&lt;a id="woodcarvingbasics"&gt;Wood Carving Basics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0205fd55f4503bb14c531d3edacbbf7a2e40d109.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6f6b937188ff34680cf1e520def165f0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Whether you’re a weekend hobbyist picking up a gouge for the first time or a dedicated maker looking to refine your technical foundations, &lt;/b&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Woodcarving Basics&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;b&gt; is the definitive guide to mastering the woodcarver’s craft.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;This comprehensive manual breaks down the complexities of traditional carving into manageable, step-by-step lessons designed to build confidence, skill, and creative independence in any home workshop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Go beyond simple whittling and explore the professional techniques that define high-quality DIY craftsmanship. This edition is tailored for the "maker" generation—those who value the tactile satisfaction of hand-tool woodworking and the practices that ensure lasting results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;What’s Inside for the Modern Maker:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;The Maker’s Toolkit:&lt;/b&gt; Detailed guidance on selecting and maintaining essential chisels, gouges, and mallets, including professional sharpening secrets for a razor-edge finish.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Material Mastery:&lt;/b&gt; Learn how to source and select the best wood species for your projects, understanding grain patterns and characteristics that affect your carving.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Foundational Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Master the core strokes for relief carving, carving in-the-round, and decorative detailing used in furniture making and home decor.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Workshop Safety &amp;amp; Ergonomics:&lt;/b&gt; Professional tips on proper grip and body positioning to ensure a safe, comfortable, and sustainable DIY practice.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Skill-Building Projects:&lt;/b&gt; Apply your techniques to classic projects that bridge the gap between basic cuts and finished, professional-grade works of art.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt; Clean, clear, and highly visual, &lt;i&gt;Woodcarving Basics&lt;/i&gt; remains an indispensable resource for anyone looking to trade the digital world for the timeless satisfaction of creating with their hands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="workbench_acompleteguidetocreatingyourperfectbench"&gt;&lt;a id="workbench_acompleteguidetocreatingyourperfectbench"&gt;The Workbench: A Complete Guide to Creating Your Perfect Bench&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/31dfdedd1c186277aa25dc35ee66530d016f8f0f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=eda7debc5ee7563e390c14d8938f05f5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;The Workbench: A Complete Guide to Creating Your Perfect Bench&lt;/i&gt; by Lon Schleining offers a fresh perspective on the essential tool in any woodworker’s shop—the workbench.&lt;/b&gt;   Whether you're a beginner or a seasoned craftsman, this guide helps you make informed decisions about choosing or building your ideal workbench.   Whether you’re looking to build a new bench from scratch or upgrade your existing setup, &lt;i&gt;The Workbench&lt;/i&gt; is your go-to resource for creating a workspace that enhances your craftsmanship and productivity. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;In-Depth Exploration:&lt;/b&gt; Dive into the history and evolution of workbenches, from traditional designs to contemporary innovations. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Detailed Plans:&lt;/b&gt; Access hundreds of options for choosing or building the perfect bench and its accessories. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expert Guidance:&lt;/b&gt; Benefit from Lori Schleining’s extensive experience and insights, ensuring your workbench is both functional and beautiful. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Visual Inspiration:&lt;/b&gt; Enjoy nearly 300 photos and drawings that illustrate various bench designs and their applications. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Practical Tips:&lt;/b&gt; Learn essential techniques for constructing, maintaining, and optimizing your workbench for different tasks. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3 id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetotablesaws"&gt;&lt;a id="tauntonscompleteillustratedguidetotablesaws"&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Tablesaws&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/af54d6463ab94309bb08d29c64c19525d4f1cce5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f5535c88856e8716f4b6ec4fb85a8eda"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;&lt;i&gt;Taunton's Complete Illustrated Guide to Tablesaws &lt;/i&gt;is the definitive resource for mastering one of the most essential tools in any woodworking shop.&lt;/b&gt;   Packed with expert advice, clear diagrams, and step-by-step instructions, this guide covers everything from choosing the right saw and blade to executing precise cuts safely and efficiently.   Whether you're a beginner looking to build confidence or a seasoned woodworker aiming to refine your technique, this comprehensive manual provides invaluable insights into setup, operation, maintenance, and advanced cutting techniques.   Learn how to make accurate rips, crosscuts, miters, bevels, dadoes, and more—safely and with professional results.&lt;h3 id="turningwoodwithrichardraffan_updatedandexpandededition"&gt;&lt;a id="turningwoodwithrichardraffan_updatedandexpandededition"&gt;Turning Wood with Richard Raffan: Updated and Expanded Edition&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/481767ef3e013a2ff36188d35d421c6710a4a6d8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=38be97c1c05fbfddaed871b2dd22db56"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Master the art of woodturning with &lt;i&gt;Turning Wood with Richard Raffan&lt;/i&gt;, the fully revised edition of Richard Raffan’s classic bestseller.&lt;/b&gt;   This essential guide offers new techniques and up-to-date information that reflects the evolution of woodturning over the decades. Whether you are a beginner or a seasoned turner, you’ll find valuable insights and expert advice to enhance your skills.  &lt;i&gt;Turning Wood with Richard Raffan&lt;/i&gt; is your ultimate guide to mastering the craft of woodturning, providing you with the knowledge and confidence to create stunning wooden pieces. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key Features:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Comprehensive Techniques:&lt;/b&gt; Discover the latest techniques and practices in woodturning, including a completely new chapter on hollow vessel turning. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Easy-to-Follow Instructions:&lt;/b&gt; Each section includes clear, step-by-step instructions that make learning simple, from selecting the right chucks and tools to mastering basic turning techniques. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Tool Maintenance and Safety:&lt;/b&gt; Learn how to sharpen and maintain your tools for optimal performance, along with essential safety practices for efficient handling. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b&gt;Expert Insights:&lt;/b&gt; Benefit from Richard Raffan’s extensive experience as an internationally acclaimed woodturning expert and teacher, making this book an indispensable resource for every turner. &lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
