tion of realistic, AAA-quality safe house props and environment assets created for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="meridian_vol57_cedarpointschool"&gt;&lt;a id="meridian_vol57_cedarpointschool"&gt;MERIDIAN VOL.57 - Cedar Point School&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d2150845af63d1fb2280de9a8b15da70b7ed42c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=24960cec35e7b20d9eca1016b4ea7dd4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of realistic, AAA-quality quarantine tent assets created for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="subwaytunnel"&gt;&lt;a id="subwaytunnel"&gt;Subway Tunnel&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0ec0502161198130f97e8d78a3d7d0971ab3f418.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=b56b8904acbf1aaf65f17cfb30efe255"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of realistic, AAA-quality mansion props and interior environment assets created for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="safehouse"&gt;&lt;a id="safehouse"&gt;Safe House&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9e84e35f534c36759e63fa27a19554b34008154e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e6a94d1f235742e6a994f60aa123c1e5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of realistic, AAA-quality animal bone props and assets created for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="quarantinetent"&gt;&lt;a id="quarantinetent"&gt;Quarantine Tent&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2e55c0f6baf11c2826d0c87081a1617b8f6c245d.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c3dcf335f6ed16aa433669f6b224df2c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A collection of realistic, AAA-quality human bone props and assets created for Unreal Engine.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="albertmansion"&gt;&lt;a id="albertmansion"&gt;Albert Mansion&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1b56235ef23e55ffc81bcb38c1ce0324f468f4a3.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp