nced Python Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pythonautomationwithfileslibrariesandtesting"&gt;Python Automation with Files Libraries and Testing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt11"&gt;Pay $11 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#apifundamentalsfornon-technicalprofessionals"&gt;API Fundamentals for Non-Technical Professionals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#browserautomationwithpythonandselenium"&gt;Browser Automation with Python and Selenium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datapreprocessingandfeatureengineeringformachinelearning"&gt;Data Preprocessing and Feature Engineering for Machine Learning&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dataanalysiswithnumpyandpandas"&gt;Data Analysis with NumPy and Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datavisualisationforanalystsanddatascientists"&gt;Data Visualisation for Analysts and Data Scientists&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#statisticsessentialsfordatadrivendecisions"&gt;Statistics Essentials for Data Driven Decisions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hypothesistestingandregressionanalysis"&gt;Hypothesis Testing and Regression Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sqlandpostgresqlfordataanalysis"&gt;SQL and PostgreSQL for Data Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sqljoinsaggregationandpythonintegration"&gt;SQL Joins Aggregation and Python Integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#machinelearninganddatasciencefoundations"&gt;Machine Learning and Data Science Foundations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#regressionmodellingwithpythonandscikit-learn"&gt;Regression Modelling with Python and Scikit-Learn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#classificationwithlogisticregressionandsupportvectormachines"&gt;Classification with Logistic Regression and Support Vector Machines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tree-basedmodelsandgradientboosting"&gt;Tree-Based Models and Gradient Boosting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#customersegmentationandclusteringwithpython"&gt;Customer Segmentation and Clustering with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#deeplearningandneuralnetworkswithtensorflow"&gt;Deep Learning and Neural Networks with TensorFlow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#computervisionwithconvolutionalneuralnetworks"&gt;Computer Vision with Convolutional Neural Networks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#naturallanguageprocessingandsentimentanalysiswithpython"&gt;Natural Language Processing and Sentiment Analysis with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#reinforcementlearninganddecisionoptimisation"&gt;Reinforcement Learning and Decision Optimisation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#promptengineeringmasterclassforprogrammers"&gt;Prompt Engineering Masterclass for Programmers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#generativeaidevelopmentandapplicationbuilding"&gt;Generative AI Development and Application Building&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#llmengineeringformodernaiapplications"&gt;LLM Engineering for Modern AI Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#fine-tuningopen-sourcelargelanguagemodels"&gt;Fine-Tuning Open-Source Large Language Models&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#retrieval-augmentedgenerationandenterpriseragsystems"&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation and Enterprise RAG Systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vectordatabasesforaiandragapplications"&gt;Vector Databases for AI and RAG Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiagentdevelopmentwithpython"&gt;AI Agent Development with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiagentsystemswithlanggraphandmcp"&gt;AI Agent Systems with LangGraph and MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#mlopsautomationandmodelmonitoring"&gt;MLOps Automation and Model Monitoring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#aiandmachinelearningdeploymenttoproduction"&gt;AI and Machine Learning Deployment to Production&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonprogrammingessentialsforbeginners"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonprogrammingessentialsforbeginners"&gt;Python Programming Essentials for Beginners&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d96b97c35f34391ac0bb21a075b7a6c800ac893f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=33ca431875823cb6cd0582f74b3a676c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Start your programming journey with a 2026 trending curriculum in Python designed for complete beginners. Learn programming fundamentals and build the confidence to write your first working programs. Explore Python concepts step by step as you develop a practical foundation for further coding. Simulation based practice helps you apply each new skill to realistic exercises.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonlogicandtextprocessingfundamentals"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonlogicandtextprocessingfundamentals"&gt;Python Logic and Text Processing Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9e8afaecdd4255992de0abb86757e62db68b99ed.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8153ca8a0f9e699fe937af1127434bb5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop coding logic through a 2026 trending curriculum that makes Python problem-solving practical. Use conditions and loops to control how a program behaves, then work with strings to process and organise text. Practise selecting the right logic for different coding tasks through realistic simulations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonfunctionsanddatastructuresmasterclass"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonfunctionsanddatastructuresmasterclass"&gt;Python Functions and Data Structures Masterclass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/898a6ed192091bf9cc5715ad0b6935ca4ca541d4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fe135593073ab2dfa40f41df6ce6fb8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to build organised Python programs through a 2026 trending curriculum in reusable code. Build functions, work with modules and explore data structures for storing and handling information. Put these techniques together in simulated programming tasks that reflect everyday development work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="object-orientedandadvancedpythonprogramming"&gt;&lt;a id="object-orientedandadvancedpythonprogramming"&gt;Object-Oriented and Advanced Python Programming&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/92b2fba1bcd57459b3611617e6b4fd6801953460.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=5c1ee9f6eaedb1ae3bb1a3813ca39a25"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Progress to object-oriented Python with a 2026 trending curriculum focused on practical programming. Learn how classes and related concepts help structure code, then explore more advanced Python techniques. Apply your knowledge in simulated development challenges and build confidence with larger programs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pythonautomationwithfileslibrariesandtesting"&gt;&lt;a id="pythonautomationwithfileslibrariesandtesting"&gt;Python Automation with Files Libraries and Testing&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8f361cb64a6bc3eabae68ea6bff17840f0175932.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=25d7e526ff83af0f2ca0f439e324a665"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make Python more useful in everyday work through a 2026 trending curriculum in automation and code quality. Work with files, external libraries and regular expressions, then learn to debug and test your programs. Simulation based practice lets you tackle realistic file-processing and troubleshooting tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt11"&gt;Pay $11 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="apifundamentalsfornon-technicalprofessionals"&gt;&lt;a id="apifundamentalsfornon-technicalprofessionals"&gt;API Fundamentals for Non-Technical Professionals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5d82c3a09fb195ed4bc12867c4710c8704bd411f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=20a9bb18f4517bf069cfec206c889a2a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore APIs through a 2026 trending curriculum designed for non-technical learners. Learn what APIs do, how they work and how to explore information about an API before trying one yourself. Use guided simulations to practise following an API workflow with greater confidence.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="browserautomationwithpythonandselenium"&gt;&lt;a id="browserautomationwithpythonandselenium"&gt;Browser Automation with Python and Selenium&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/8ecaeffd2517eea94a81856043be63fbc1c45d86.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e96903454f90f36b0b5b24ca4e313ccf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build browser automation skills through a 2026 trending curriculum in Selenium and Python. Set up browser execution, identify elements with different locators and interact with web pages using WebDriver. Practise timing and synchronisation with explicit and implicit waits in simulated automation scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datapreprocessingandfeatureengineeringformachinelearning"&gt;&lt;a id="datapreprocessingandfeatureengineeringformachinelearning"&gt;Data Preprocessing and Feature Engineering for Machine Learning&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b39ad121a1a0e93791babf699f0bad04f7729c17.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6e1fa60a4060b774dcc94d1f915b3b1d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Prepare for modern data workflows with a 2026 trending curriculum in preprocessing. Learn how preprocessing prepares datasets and practise applying the process in Python before modelling. Simulation based practice helps you recognise common data preparation steps and work through them in context.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dataanalysiswithnumpyandpandas"&gt;&lt;a id="dataanalysiswithnumpyandpandas"&gt;Data Analysis with NumPy and Pandas&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4761645fd66cd6e15310b811eb3523cf8fd08a70.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=a42f66743a1f458bbdfdc36742c0a99a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to work confidently with data through a 2026 trending curriculum in NumPy and Pandas. Explore arrays, data handling and different data sources while working through dedicated challenges for both libraries. Apply your skills in simulated analysis tasks that mirror practical data work.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datavisualisationforanalystsanddatascientists"&gt;&lt;a id="datavisualisationforanalystsanddatascientists"&gt;Data Visualisation for Analysts and Data Scientists&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/79d652b9dbedf357705adc8cb83f63be8c12ea78.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=805df10bd5fbd76ee2a75f80281a1095"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring data to life through a 2026 trending curriculum in visual analysis. Create visualisations with Matplotlib, Seaborn and Plotly Express, then strengthen your skills with practical challenges. Use simulated analysis scenarios to choose and present charts suited to the data.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="statisticsessentialsfordatadrivendecisions"&gt;&lt;a id="statisticsessentialsfordatadrivendecisions"&gt;Statistics Essentials for Data Driven Decisions&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1df26f161f0c625c753681ce2276cf1322126214.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=28720f758ff441979acda3cedeb3355c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Strengthen your statistical thinking through a 2026 trending curriculum for data-driven decisions. Explore descriptive measures, distributions, estimates and confidence intervals, including worked examples of descriptive and inferential statistics. Practise interpreting results through simulated decision-making scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hypothesistestingandregressionanalysis"&gt;&lt;a id="hypothesistestingandregressionanalysis"&gt;Hypothesis Testing and Regression Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6417578781ea9b634308117aa1ae38fa411f1022.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=7523492c5fca56fd72c109519806fb6a"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build practical analytical judgement through a 2026 trending curriculum in testing and regression. Work through hypothesis testing, regression fundamentals, model assumptions and categorical data using practical examples. Simulation based practice helps you interpret findings and make more careful analytical decisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sqlandpostgresqlfordataanalysis"&gt;&lt;a id="sqlandpostgresqlfordataanalysis"&gt;SQL and PostgreSQL for Data Analysis&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0efc90cca713d9070decec16619b4b3520af2fe6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=82950f81ae88053d9e136d647bbcf10f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop database skills through a 2026 trending curriculum in SQL and PostgreSQL. Learn the fundamental SQL statements that help you retrieve and explore information in a structured database. Apply each concept through simulated query-writing tasks based on realistic data questions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sqljoinsaggregationandpythonintegration"&gt;&lt;a id="sqljoinsaggregationandpythonintegration"&gt;SQL Joins Aggregation and Python Integration&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cab7081c99afa44adac13fc67bc6b6748c4489f7.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=38fbdda6ecbb6bb83382ed80602305a9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take SQL further with a 2026 trending curriculum covering joins, summaries and Python integration. Use GROUP BY statements to summarise results, JOINs to connect tables and Python to work with PostgreSQL. Build confidence through simulated analysis tasks that combine these techniques.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="machinelearninganddatasciencefoundations"&gt;&lt;a id="machinelearninganddatasciencefoundations"&gt;Machine Learning and Data Science Foundations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/43b8d24f2a5e869797c0e2476d021a5cea79c451.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=29680289445baeb98f743909893d7c93"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter the world of data science through an AI-focused introduction to machine learning. Learn the core ideas behind both fields and see how they support modern analytical workflows. Simulation based practice helps you connect foundational concepts to realistic data problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="regressionmodellingwithpythonandscikit-learn"&gt;&lt;a id="regressionmodellingwithpythonandscikit-learn"&gt;Regression Modelling with Python and Scikit-Learn&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/358ae77befae3e82a1da515638236df6f7011543.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e4367bc75ce68bea7ef15bbad81d0be4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build predictive modelling skills through an AI-focused study of regression techniques. Build simple and multiple linear regression models with Python and scikit-learn. Use simulated modelling tasks to practise interpreting outputs and choosing an approach for the question at hand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="classificationwithlogisticregressionandsupportvectormachines"&gt;&lt;a id="classificationwithlogisticregressionandsupportvectormachines"&gt;Classification with Logistic Regression and Support Vector Machines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c43c3915152ae9825651afbed3ea7a289c929961.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=68f33fed7a3ad3c86a89984459756af4"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn how AI systems classify data through an applied curriculum in machine learning. Work with logistic regression, K-nearest neighbours and support vector machines while comparing their approaches. Simulation based practice helps you apply classification methods to realistic example problems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tree-basedmodelsandgradientboosting"&gt;&lt;a id="tree-basedmodelsandgradientboosting"&gt;Tree-Based Models and Gradient Boosting&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/94b2ad39573102e213e0c3535302a10926eb9c3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bfdcbe200ee273f07e063d432c5297c5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore AI-focused predictive modelling with tree methods and gradient boosting. Explore decision trees, random forests, model selection and XGBoost through a connected learning journey. Test your knowledge with simulated modelling scenarios and compare different approaches.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="customersegmentationandclusteringwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="customersegmentationandclusteringwithpython"&gt;Customer Segmentation and Clustering with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d5a133b6cbe089d511989605d8a3ba25f9fbd568.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=17bbdd88209d00cc32589260d0266158"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Discover how AI-driven analytics can reveal useful patterns in customer data. Learn K-means and hierarchical clustering and explore how each method forms segments. Practise applying the techniques through simulated customer analysis scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="deeplearningandneuralnetworkswithtensorflow"&gt;&lt;a id="deeplearningandneuralnetworkswithtensorflow"&gt;Deep Learning and Neural Networks with TensorFlow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/51c3377c700b6e4c2c9ed776cfa72560fed0b4c8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9587ea89e2f5b1d4cd838a7f3f3edd60"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a foundation in AI-focused deep learning with neural networks and TensorFlow. Explore how artificial neural networks work and develop your understanding using TensorFlow. Simulation based practice helps you connect network concepts to realistic model-building tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="computervisionwithconvolutionalneuralnetworks"&gt;&lt;a id="computervisionwithconvolutionalneuralnetworks"&gt;Computer Vision with Convolutional Neural Networks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/aba0bd85c2419bc40736fd4c25f781f459bcc9de.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bbd35ba439308a28af37a9eed29de13c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the AI methods that help computers recognise patterns in images. Learn how convolutional neural networks identify visual patterns and support computer vision. Apply the concepts through simulated image-analysis and model interpretation exercises.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="naturallanguageprocessingandsentimentanalysiswithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="naturallanguageprocessingandsentimentanalysiswithpython"&gt;Natural Language Processing and Sentiment Analysis with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b3743105a586046c7bce9271b5e41856a7182c3a.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e943a0e8139748ce3feb35420996070b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Work with AI-focused language analysis and discover how Python can interpret text and sentiment. Explore natural language processing concepts and examine how text can be prepared and interpreted. Simulation based practice helps you work through realistic language-analysis tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="reinforcementlearninganddecisionoptimisation"&gt;&lt;a id="reinforcementlearninganddecisionoptimisation"&gt;Reinforcement Learning and Decision Optimisation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/35827d4edfa11bff741cc218ceed8d0fa7ad1392.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=c2f8311acb20965c2e190b266160b2aa"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore AI-focused decision methods used when systems learn from their choices. Learn how upper confidence bound and Thompson sampling balance exploration and choice. Practise comparing these approaches through simulated decision scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="promptengineeringmasterclassforprogrammers"&gt;&lt;a id="promptengineeringmasterclassforprogrammers"&gt;Prompt Engineering Masterclass for Programmers&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/5e6147c8f780409d652544c273fb9819da944ec1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=acee7e78c8c892c58e8f63074ae83777"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop stronger prompting skills within an AI-focused curriculum for programmers. Explore ChatGPT prompting, how large language models are trained and how they generate responses. Apply the ideas through simulated prompting tasks and structured experiments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="generativeaidevelopmentandapplicationbuilding"&gt;&lt;a id="generativeaidevelopmentandapplicationbuilding"&gt;Generative AI Development and Application Building&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d09106d3f83ec7e81c5f886c2b203ddb065b2c6c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=df9000b93c17852da8010b716e0709d8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to create practical software with an AI-focused development curriculum. Explore AI-powered applications and build websites using Claude, Gemini and OpenAI technologies. Simulation based practice lets you plan and test realistic app-building workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="llmengineeringformodernaiapplications"&gt;&lt;a id="llmengineeringformodernaiapplications"&gt;LLM Engineering for Modern AI Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c07b1cbd879fe40ec977a2b093bd50100f31beb1.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=071c9fd3a4cea57067aa498af51727a5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Move from AI concepts to working applications by building projects with large language models. Build a character chatbot, a vision-based calorie tracker and an adaptive tutor with the OpenAI API and Gradio. Practise each stage through simulated development and testing scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="fine-tuningopen-sourcelargelanguagemodels"&gt;&lt;a id="fine-tuningopen-sourcelargelanguagemodels"&gt;Fine-Tuning Open-Source Large Language Models&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/98d38debaae35876ef96be6420dac05079ee8266.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=e63947e93619cec16498ea60f0dde1c8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Adapt open-source language models through an AI-focused fine-tuning curriculum. Learn about self-hostable models and fine-tuning with LoRA, SFTTrainer, PEFT and TRL. Use simulated model-development tasks to understand the workflow from preparation to evaluation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="retrieval-augmentedgenerationandenterpriseragsystems"&gt;&lt;a id="retrieval-augmentedgenerationandenterpriseragsystems"&gt;Retrieval-Augmented Generation and Enterprise RAG Systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/f1d86ee8c0f7745cfac526eec674847bbce33e07.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f1287649f731bc98fe7158bad3549347"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore AI-focused retrieval methods for applications that need access to relevant knowledge. Build retrieval-augmented generation pipelines with LangChain and explore how retrieval supports grounded responses. Simulation based practice helps you work through realistic knowledge-search scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vectordatabasesforaiandragapplications"&gt;&lt;a id="vectordatabasesforaiandragapplications"&gt;Vector Databases for AI and RAG Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/605d12965f1cbf9bcffc4d08b8b8c1ad6e20e327.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=59b04f5f2cf2ad360817c2237f9141d0"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build the data foundations for AI applications through an in-depth look at vector databases. Explore vector similarity, build with Chroma and examine Pinecone as another vector database option. Practise selecting and applying these tools in simulated retrieval tasks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiagentdevelopmentwithpython"&gt;&lt;a id="aiagentdevelopmentwithpython"&gt;AI Agent Development with Python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/4b87606217535a3dea931ecda6aa9f8aeb17df75.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=25efea64b34effcfbd9f448aad76f7c9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop practical AI agents with Python and explore how they manage connected tasks. Develop a practical agent, then add memory and persistent database memory to its workflow. Simulation based practice helps you test how an agent behaves across realistic scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiagentsystemswithlanggraphandmcp"&gt;&lt;a id="aiagentsystemswithlanggraphandmcp"&gt;AI Agent Systems with LangGraph and MCP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b7238f855e82f7df22bc7399c232c2976ac38cd8.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=cec8acdf49e6a32026ae3dcc5853d7ec"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Design AI agent systems with modern workflow tools and integration methods. Explore LangGraph, Model Context Protocol and the OpenAI Agents SDK while building agent-based systems. Practise connecting tools and managing workflow steps through simulations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mlopsautomationandmodelmonitoring"&gt;&lt;a id="mlopsautomationandmodelmonitoring"&gt;MLOps Automation and Model Monitoring&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/42a2c8757d643021037f11f1605b85cf354d2436.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=3a9e6c0e05cbcc594be59a49b69cef50"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to keep AI models reliable after development with automated workflows and monitoring. Explore automated CI/CD pipelines with AWS, then study monitoring and ongoing maintenance. Simulation based practice helps you work through realistic deployment and monitoring situations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="aiandmachinelearningdeploymenttoproduction"&gt;&lt;a id="aiandmachinelearningdeploymenttoproduction"&gt;AI and Machine Learning Deployment to Production&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/24195518298e0f98ad3144d0e3e47b74769cdd3c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=af23419313d9f424be7268a7935356d8"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take AI and machine learning solutions towards production through deployment-focused study. Explore AWS model deployment, Vertex AI customisation and training, and web applications built with Flask. Practise combining these elements through simulated production workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
