      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/85c8f3cca0a6d60b6e58e2b05c218f738fa3383b.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=91fd3fbdfaf17769a1ba4b3f8b417cf8"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c612ec42302001a45502c7788509bbc2bf151977.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=a9988e271886d1d8d16733a84a797a7d"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Step into your own Unreal worlds.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Let’s build video games! Create your next project with one of the most powerful and approachable engines on the market with the Unreal Game Dev Collection, a curated bundle by our favorite publishers that offers detailed assets for developers of all levels. Quickly establish settings with the &lt;em&gt;Barcelona Square Environment&lt;/em&gt;, the &lt;em&gt;Riverside European Village Environment&lt;/em&gt;, or &lt;em&gt;The Bone Temple&lt;/em&gt;. Then, fill your worlds with realistic vehicles, powerful spells, and so much more. Get the assets you need to help bring your game to life, and help support DonorsChoose with your purchase! &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys Expire. Please redeem before October 15th, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;iframe width="400" height="315" src="https://www.youtube.com/embed/oxb-PB_hivs?si=B6k_znFG-SEkndNR" title="YouTube video player" frameborder="0" allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share" referrerpolicy="strict-origin-when-cross-origin" allowfullscreen&gt;&lt;/iframe&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#retrosci-firesearchcabinenvironment"&gt;Retro Sci-Fi Research Cabin Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stylizedslashes_vol2_niagara"&gt;Stylized Slashes Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#volcanolandenvironmentwandterrainscattertoolunrealengine"&gt;Volcano Land Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#motelfurniturepropspack"&gt;Motel Furniture Props Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#prison"&gt;Prison&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#rail-mountedgantrycrane"&gt;Rail-Mounted Gantry Crane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stylizedjapanesestreet"&gt;Stylized Japanese Street&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#riversideeuropeanvillageenvironment"&gt;Riverside European Village Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sci-fipolarstationenvironment"&gt;Sci-Fi Polar Station Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#barcelonasquareenvironment"&gt;Barcelona Square Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#containerdisctrictenvironment"&gt;Container Disctrict Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ancientdesertruinsenvironment"&gt;Ancient Desert Ruins Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#alienplanetsenvironment"&gt;Alien Planets Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#orbitalbaseenvironment"&gt;Orbital Base Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sci-fipropspack_vol1"&gt;Sci-fi Props Pack Vol.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ethnicfurniturepropspack"&gt;Ethnic Furniture Props Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#post-sovietworld"&gt;Post-Soviet World&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#post-sovietworld20"&gt;Post-Soviet World 2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bonetemple"&gt;The Bone Temple&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#spacecolonyandsci-ficity"&gt;Space Colony &amp; Sci-Fi City&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#post-apocalypticwasteland"&gt;Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#concreteshelterandbunkerconstructor"&gt;Concrete Shelter &amp; Bunker Constructor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#warehousebigpack"&gt;Warehouse Big Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#residentialbuildings"&gt;Residential Buildings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#planesinthesky"&gt;Planes in the Sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#waterslidesystem"&gt;Water Slide System&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#industrialpiperack"&gt;Industrial Pipe Rack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#casino"&gt;Casino&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#militaryvehiclespack"&gt;Military Vehicles Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#magicprojectiles_vol5_niagara"&gt;Magic Projectiles Vol.5 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#stylizedshields_vol1_niagara"&gt;Stylized Shields Vol.1 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#toonexplosions_vol2_niagara"&gt;Toon Explosions Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#toonexplosions_vol1_niagara"&gt;Toon Explosions Vol.1 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#magicprojectiles_vol4_niagara"&gt;Magic Projectiles Vol.4 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#lootdrops_vol2_niagara"&gt;Loot Drops Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#steampunkzeppelinstation"&gt;Steampunk Zeppelin Station&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#steampunkmodularcafeenvironment"&gt;Steampunk Modular Cafe Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="retrosci-firesearchcabinenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="retrosci-firesearchcabinenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/pYvo_nKnLA8"&gt;Retro Sci-Fi Research Cabin Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.6–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build retro-futuristic laboratories and living spaces with 84 unique meshes, modular interiors, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and detailed vintage research equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable emissive screens and lamps, optimized assets, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, floors, and furniture for flexible interior layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Vintage computers, printers, oscillographs, and control panels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Holographic projectors, robotic arms, and research props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable emissive lighting for screens and lamps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Packed Metallic/Roughness/AO textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stylizedslashes_vol2_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="stylizedslashes_vol2_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/vVzktKrhb58"&gt;Stylized Slashes Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your attacks visual impact with 20 stylized slash effects, created entirely with Niagara.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable scale and delays let you match each effect to your combat timing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 20 stylized slash effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Built entirely with Niagara.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Adjustable scale for different attack sizes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable delays to suit attack sequences.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="volcanolandenvironmentwandterrainscattertoolunrealengine"&gt;&lt;a id="volcanolandenvironmentwandterrainscattertoolunrealengine" href="https://youtu.be/mnUQ42wC2-s"&gt;Volcano Land Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build volcanic landscapes with the Terrain Scatter Tool, lava rivers, and lava, fire, smoke &amp;amp; heat distortion VFX.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable terrain materials, adjustable scatter density, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- PCG tools to scatter rocks, debris, small hills, and trees.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Adjustable scatter density for flexible terrain creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Easily placed lava rivers with control over placement and flow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Lava, fire, smoke, and heat distortion effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable landscape material and realistic surface materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Packed Metallic/Roughness/AO textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: Procedural Content Generation Framework (PCG).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="motelfurniturepropspack"&gt;&lt;a id="motelfurniturepropspack"&gt;Motel Furniture Props Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/58afcfc8c1edb1a285fac7062f660d7e3443c0f2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=f2765c7fc9f8e1187acc8984e8c29596"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create nostalgic motel interiors with vintage furniture, reception desks, bedroom essentials, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;bathroom fixtures, and laundry equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Mix and match props for cozy roadside inns, abandoned hotels, or atmospheric horror scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Assets Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Beds, reception desks, and furniture for varied room layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Bathroom fixtures and laundry room equipment.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Wall decorations and small everyday props for a lived-in feel.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Versatile selection for bedrooms, reception areas, and service rooms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Ideal for retro settings, horror games, and cinematic environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="prison"&gt;&lt;a id="prison" href="https://youtu.be/RGXzBEOlLes"&gt;Prison&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build functioning or abandoned prisons with modular assets for interiors and exteriors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Interchangeable materials and a wide variety of props let you create your own prison setting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular construction pieces for flexible prison layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Assets for both interior and exterior environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interchangeable materials for varied looks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Extensive props for detailed scene dressing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Suitable for active facilities or abandoned prison settings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rail-mountedgantrycrane"&gt;&lt;a id="rail-mountedgantrycrane" href="https://youtu.be/UULM-7zSSUk"&gt;Rail-Mounted Gantry Crane&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.6–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring container yards to life with a working rail-mounted gantry crane that &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;automatically picks up, moves, and stacks containers. Customizable rail length, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;randomized container appearances, and night lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Crane meshes with separate moving parts, rails, end stops, and a shipping container.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Container Yard Blueprint for stacked containers with randomized colors, rust, and dirt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Crane Blueprint combining a customizable yard with an operating crane.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Automatic cycle to pick up, relocate, and release containers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Adjustable crane color, weathering, rail length, and part positions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Spotlights for night operations and aviation obstruction lights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Designed with performance in mind.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stylizedjapanesestreet"&gt;&lt;a id="stylizedjapanesestreet" href="https://youtu.be/UrWHb3xkCFY"&gt;Stylized Japanese Street&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.1–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build colorful Tokyo-inspired backstreets with modular buildings, market stalls, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;signs, and detailed street props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Stylized materials, optimized LODs, and a complete showcase level, designed for Lumen lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, windows, balconies, doors, and building structures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Fruit stands, umbrellas, crates, cloth props, and vending details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Electric poles, air conditioners, pipes, signs, and street lamps.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Hand-crafted textures with a soft, stylized look.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Individually editable elements for flexible layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized geometry, LODs, and materials for real-time use.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Fully assembled showcase level included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Designed for Lumen real-time lighting without baked lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt25"&gt;Pay $25 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="riversideeuropeanvillageenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="riversideeuropeanvillageenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/vwRIOfLuK88"&gt;Riverside European Village Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.6–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a historic European village with 247 modular assets, furnished tavern interiors, marketplaces, and river docks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable materials, optimized meshes, demo and overview maps, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features: &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, roofs, windows, timber beams, and docks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Furnished tavern interior with medieval furniture and tableware.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Marketplace and riverside props, including rowboats, crates, and barrels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- World-aligned wall materials with vertex painting for moss, dirt, and worn plaster.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Packed texture maps, consistent texel density, and custom collisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps for easy scene building and asset browsing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-fipolarstationenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-fipolarstationenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/jD2jEMi_c_k"&gt;Sci-Fi Polar Station Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.6–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a frozen sci-fi research station with 78 unique meshes, modular labs, corridors, and vehicle hangars.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;4 detailed vehicles, customizable emissive lighting, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, floors, and structural frames for flexible base layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Arctic Buggy, Bulldozer, Industrial Excavator, and Snowmobile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Robotic arms, lab terminals, monitors, and holographic diagnostics.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable emissive lamps and screens.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized meshes and packed ORM textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="barcelonasquareenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="barcelonasquareenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/aS9yhi8p-iQ"&gt;Barcelona Square Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a Mediterranean square inspired by Barcelona’s Plaça Reial with 132 unique meshes and fully modular architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Detailed arcades, outdoor cafés, palm trees, and a central fountain. Lumen lighting &amp;amp; optimized LODs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular façades, balconies, arcades, and classical architectural details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Café furniture, umbrellas, bicycles, benches, and street props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Central fountain, palm trees, and decorative vegetation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Up to 4 LOD levels per asset, depending on the mesh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Decals for weathering and surface variation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Ready-made demo environment included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Exterior architecture and accessible arcades only. Full building interiors and unseen rear sections are not included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="containerdisctrictenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="containerdisctrictenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/j-wj1k7oQsQ"&gt;Container Disctrict Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a container city with 332 unique meshes, modular container parts, and detailed interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create custom layouts with the Container Tool, plus Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Container Tool with a detailed tutorial for quick setup.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular container structures with fully modeled interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Antenna Tool and cable blueprints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Two lighting setups: Overcast and Sunrise.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- World-aligned wall mask material and packed ORM textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Hand-drawn decals and customizable decal blueprints.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ancientdesertruinsenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="ancientdesertruinsenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/fZNTiEHISR0"&gt;Ancient Desert Ruins Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build ancient desert ruins with 170 high-quality meshes, modular structures, and the Map Generator PCG.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Spline-based paths and fences, dusty atmosphere effects, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular assets for flexible environment layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- PCG Biome with spline-based path creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Fence Blueprint for customizable borders.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- World-aligned wall material with vertex painting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Volumetric fog planes for dust and atmospheric effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Hand-drawn decals and packed ORM textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three background mountains.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugins: Procedural Content Generation Framework (PCG), LandscapePatch, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PCGGeometryScriptInterop, and PCGExternalDataInterop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="alienplanetsenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="alienplanetsenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/hSq2-QrE9Ow"&gt;Alien Planets Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create alien worlds with 173 high-quality meshes, Planet Creator PCG Biome, and 4 ready-made planet environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable trees, spline-based paths, 3 Niagara effects, and Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable PCG Biome and Blueprint tools for building detailed environments. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Spline-based path creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Six decoration options per tree, with high, medium, and low detail choices.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three Niagara effects to enhance your alien landscapes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized assets and packed ORM textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Four demo maps and an asset overview map included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Required Plugins: Procedural Content Generation Framework (PCG), PCGGeometryScriptInterop, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- and PCGExternalDataInterop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="orbitalbaseenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="orbitalbaseenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/0jT_MhPKo1w"&gt;Orbital Base Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build expansive orbital bases with modular domes, sci-fi platforms, and 6 construction tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Customizable materials, detailed sci-fi props, Lumen &amp;amp; Nanite support.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular dome structures and floor panels for spacious bases, arenas, and observation decks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Dome Tool: Create glass domes for habitats and agriculture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Plant Farm Tool: Populate domes with vegetation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Light Pole Tool: Add dynamic sci-fi lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Battery Charger Tool: Set up power storage and charging systems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular Crate Tool: Generate randomized crate stacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Solar Panel Tool: Place and orient solar panels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Control panels, crates, screens, and machinery.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable colors and emissive lighting, world-aligned materials, and decals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized geometry and packed Metallic/Roughness/AO textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: Procedural Content Generation Framework (PCG).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-fipropspack_vol1"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-fipropspack_vol1"&gt;Sci-fi Props Pack Vol.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6667b829845540e3620246ae88325630f71bb827.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=fa03471e4789941d59858ebf278e2e26"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.3–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Populate futuristic worlds with detailed sci-fi props, from consoles and medical devices &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;to robotic tools and modular furniture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Optimized models &amp;amp; PBR materials for labs, starships, space colonies, and post-apocalyptic scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Assets Fab Page   &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Sci-fi equipment, consoles, medical devices, robotic tools, and toys.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular furniture, large machines, and small decorative props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- PBR materials for realistic surfaces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Detailed models suitable for close-up shots and larger environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized for games, cinematics, and visualization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ethnicfurniturepropspack"&gt;&lt;a id="ethnicfurniturepropspack"&gt;Ethnic Furniture Props Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/90f16f0d157028f6fb4f4e22bae4b7a111cbc4c0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=30009eec1964a80720541d814630b92d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.4–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring warmth and character to traditional homes, historic villages, and fantasy inns with &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;52 unique furniture and decorative props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PBR materials, optimized meshes &amp;amp; easy drag-and-drop setup for interior and exterior scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Befour Studios Assets Fab Page  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Traditional beds, wooden chairs, benches, sofas, and seating sets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Decorative wardrobes, cabinets, tables, and small interior accessories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Vintage bathtub and sink assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Pots, jars, vases, retro lamps, pillows, and cushions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Detailed textures and culturally inspired designs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Suitable for games, cinematics, and architectural visualization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="post-sovietworld"&gt;&lt;a id="post-sovietworld" href="https://youtu.be/qFxDSozhnms"&gt;Post-Soviet World&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build Russian and Eastern European neighborhoods with 306 unique meshes, modular architecture, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and varied street props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One finished, game-ready apartment included, ready to duplicate and customize.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, windows, doors, roofs, stairs, railings, and balconies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Hedges, street lamps, pipes, furniture, antennas, and satellite dishes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Vertex painting options on most assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interchangeable PBR materials and a multilayer landscape material.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular prefabs, LODs, and custom or automatically generated collisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 381 materials and material instances, plus 742 textures up to 4K.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interior Scope: Only one apartment is fully finished. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Duplicate and modify it or build additional layouts using the included assets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="post-sovietworld20"&gt;&lt;a id="post-sovietworld20" href="https://youtu.be/bLEYemBmAaI"&gt;Post-Soviet World 2.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a snowy Eastern European town with 1,000+ meshes, customizable materials, and enterable buildings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;One fully furnished showcase apartment, additional unfurnished interiors, LODs &amp;amp; optional Nanite.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Enterable buildings with interior walls, floors, windows, and doorframes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- One fully furnished apartment on the third floor of the 16-storey building.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Additional apartments ready to furnish and customize.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Drag-and-drop house level instances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- LODs for all meshes. Nanite is disabled by default and can be enabled selectively, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;excluding windows and balconies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: HDRIBackdrop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="bonetemple"&gt;&lt;a id="bonetemple" href="https://youtu.be/rV88sWyEDpE"&gt;The Bone Temple&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.1–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create haunting ritual sites with detailed bones, skulls, wooden structures, and occult props for horror, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;survival, and dark fantasy worlds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;3 demo maps, customizable rune decals, and Nanite &amp;amp; reduced-poly mesh options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Bones, skulls, skeleton prefabs, creepy masks, and Halloween pumpkins.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Wooden structures, tents, fabrics, banners, debris, and clutter.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Iron and wooden light sources.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three demo maps with different weather and lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Nanite and lighter versions with standard LODs for most high-poly meshes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Rune and symbol decals with adjustable color, roughness, and contrast.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Mushrooms with customizable glowing materials, ready for foliage painting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Required Plugin: HDRIBackdrop.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="spacecolonyandsci-ficity"&gt;&lt;a id="spacecolonyandsci-ficity" href="https://youtu.be/aGFuB5BKWVo"&gt;Space Colony &amp; Sci-Fi City&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build space colonies, futuristic cities, and research stations with modular architecture, prefabs, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and versatile interior props.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create sci-fi, cyberpunk, or space horror environments, with a new demo map for UE 5.6+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular building pieces and prefabs for stations and entire cities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Props for bars, hotels, offices, schools, and living quarters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Flexible assets for planetary outposts and futuristic urban settings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Options for vaporwave-inspired environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- New map and a 1.5-hour level design video for inspiration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: HDRI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="post-apocalypticwasteland"&gt;&lt;a id="post-apocalypticwasteland" href="https://youtu.be/IE-Hh-HjtEA"&gt;Post-Apocalyptic Wasteland&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build gritty wastelands with modular elements, props, clutter, and debris for post-apocalyptic, survival, and horror scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;A new map with 2 variants is included for UE 5.6+.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular elements for customizable wasteland environments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Varied props, clutter, and debris for detailed scene dressing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Rugged aesthetics inspired by Mad Max and Fallout.ü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- New map in two variants for Unreal Engine 5.6+.ü&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: HDRI.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="concreteshelterandbunkerconstructor"&gt;&lt;a id="concreteshelterandbunkerconstructor" href="https://youtu.be/5zsfjYPh1Ks"&gt;Concrete Shelter &amp; Bunker Constructor&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build underground bunkers and above-ground shelter towns with customizable modular assets, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Blueprint prefabs, and furniture. A large town map with daytime and nighttime versions features &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;concrete shelters, watchtowers, and detailed surroundings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Extensive underground environment with modular construction pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable assets and Blueprint prefabs for flexible layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Furniture and furniture prefabs for interior scene dressing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Above-ground town with concrete shelters and watchtowers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Daytime and nighttime versions of the new map.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="warehousebigpack"&gt;&lt;a id="warehousebigpack"&gt;Warehouse Big Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/00882739c05f944ccb7380cb2c68e589146e667e.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=77a3d4a39b75b752614b2cb9ca0e223c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build detailed warehouses with 365 meshes, 21 Blueprints, modular building parts,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; and extensive cargo props. Automatic cargo-filled racking, interactive doors, handling &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;equipment, and 70 decals speed up scene creation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular walls, roofs, floors, beams, stairs, ramps, and loading docks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Racking Blueprint to quickly populate warehouses with shelves and cargo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Boxes, crates, pallets, drums, tanks, bags, and industrial supplies.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Handling equipment assembled from separate parts for customization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Interactive doors, a physics-based toilet door, and a collapsing walkway trap.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three spline-based wire types, lamp Blueprints, and air conditioners with rotating fans and sound.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Sign, leak, and graffiti decals with a placement Blueprint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 245 materials, 220 textures, and 7 sounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="residentialbuildings"&gt;&lt;a id="residentialbuildings" href="https://youtu.be/m3NUELG3_RQ"&gt;Residential Buildings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.2–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create residential neighborhoods with 17 customizable buildings, a Building Blueprint, and a Day/Night Cycle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Custom layouts, automatic roofs, and randomized window lighting. Exteriors only, no interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Build custom structures using 13 main and 8 additional mesh types.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Automatic rectangular roofs with fences, plus extra meshes for custom roof shapes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Roof and balcony props, people, and animated air conditioner fans.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Nine window parallax images to simulate interiors.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable wall materials, brick options, and wall color decals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Day/Night Cycle with sun movement, moon, and automatic window lighting.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Instanced meshes, efficient LODs, and game-ready collisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Supports baked lighting, Lumen, mobile, and path tracing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Building overview map included. The city shown in screenshots is not included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="planesinthesky"&gt;&lt;a id="planesinthesky" href="https://youtu.be/9E7_TwMnibo"&gt;Planes in the Sky&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fill your skies with automatic background air traffic using a simple drag-and-drop Blueprint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Realistic aircraft movement, contrails, engine sounds, and night lighting, with two low-poly plane models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Aircraft automatically fly across your level at varying heights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Contrails, engine sounds, and realistic aircraft lights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Quick setup by adding the Blueprint to your scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Two low-poly plane meshes, plus landing gear variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized for background use in games, open worlds, simulations, and architectural visualization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="waterslidesystem"&gt;&lt;a id="waterslidesystem" href="https://youtu.be/pbSWZR3vCXU"&gt;Water Slide System&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.2–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create rideable water slides with a customizable spline-based system, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a physics-based tube, and a pool Blueprint. 44 meshes, water effects, sounds, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and a demo map with 8 ready-made slides.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Spline-based Water Slide Blueprint for custom slide layouts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Physics-based Tube Pawn for riding slides.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Rectangular Pool Blueprint for creating landing pools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Flumes, stairs, pillars, ladders, signs, and a waterfall mesh.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three particle effects for splashes and waterfall foam.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 57 materials, 21 textures, and 5 sounds.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo map with eight slides and a bonus Teleport Blueprint.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="industrialpiperack"&gt;&lt;a id="industrialpiperack"&gt;Industrial Pipe Rack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b4ac7c92e38a5a527a1c08a5ee55bced40c94cec.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ffb794999968bdc6471be6d5747b8535"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.6–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build industrial pipe racks and walkable elevated routes with 9 modular meshes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Quick grid-based assembly, Nanite meshes, and an optimized setup using just 2 textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular pieces for fast pipe rack construction.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Supports 100 cm and 500 cm grid snapping.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Walkable structures for character traversal.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Nanite meshes with only two textures.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Ideal for industrial backgrounds and elevated walkways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="casino"&gt;&lt;a id="casino" href="https://youtu.be/S4yj08NGbSA"&gt;Casino&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.2–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create realistic casinos with 77 meshes, 20 Blueprints, gaming tables, slot machine displays,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; and decorative lighting.Physics-enabled rope barriers, customizable materials, and casino &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;ambience for games and architectural visualization.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Roulette, blackjack, and poker tables, plus chair and table prefabs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Cards, chips, decorations, walls, and ceiling lights.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Blueprints for circular slot machine arrangements and spline-based floor and ceiling meshes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Rope barriers with static Nanite or interactive physics modes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 79 materials, including carpets, tiles, leather, metal, and wood.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 24 textures and a looping casino ambience sound.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo and overview maps included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Limitations: Playing cards are a partial set. Slot machines are not interactive.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="militaryvehiclespack"&gt;&lt;a id="militaryvehiclespack" href="https://youtu.be/MOjwHvrQkvs"&gt;Military Vehicles Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Drive 4 military vehicles: off-road, armored, truck, and light utility models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Working suspension, realistic engine sounds, customizable wear, and a vehicle testing map.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Drivable vehicles with Enhanced Input, chase cameras, exhaust smoke, and collisions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Adjustable rust and wear, with paint options on armored, truck, and light vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Opening doors, rotating steering wheels, dashboard gauges, and interior cameras on armored, truck, and light vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Working vehicle lights and adjustable glass dirt on supported models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Truck options for cargo bed, tent, and tent frame.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Show or hide selected parts on the light military vehicle.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Armored and light military vehicles are multiplayer ready.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Tested compatibility with Rush Hour – Vehicle Animator.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Note: The off-road military vehicle is exterior only.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Required Plugin: ChaosVehiclePlugin.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="magicprojectiles_vol5_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="magicprojectiles_vol5_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/EEsqObaUlCg"&gt;Magic Projectiles Vol.5 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Power up your combat with 60 projectiles, 60 impacts, and 60 muzzle effects, with 20 unique &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;designs per category.Fireballs, rockets, lightning, bullets, and more, with customizable&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; colors, scale, and speed for PC and mobile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Orbs, fireworks, darts, and other projectile styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Mix and match projectiles, impacts, and muzzles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Adjust scale, color, speed, accuracy, and other parameters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Shooting demo included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Textures for trails, flares, noise, gradients, and impacts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Materials featuring distortion, dissolve, glow, Fresnel, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Suitable for varied genres and art styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Plugin Note: Niagara and Niagara Extras may need to be enabled.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="stylizedshields_vol1_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="stylizedshields_vol1_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/euQv-KpNliQ"&gt;Stylized Shields Vol.1 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Protect your characters with 17 stylized Niagara shield effects, from elemental barriers to cosmic &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;and cyber shields.Easy to scale, with distinctive designs for fantasy, sci-fi, and magical combat.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Fire, ice, lightning, poison, rock, water, and wind shields.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Blood, cat, cosmic, holy, ink, light, shadow, and water petal designs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Two cyber shield variants.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Niagara GPU and mesh emitters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 68 textures, including noise, gradients, icons, flipbooks, and flares.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Four materials with 88 instances, featuring distortion, erosion, Fresnel, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Nine meshes and one Blueprint included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="toonexplosions_vol2_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="toonexplosions_vol2_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/LUi9z2nXSSw"&gt;Toon Explosions Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add explosive action with 41 toon Niagara effects, including ground blasts, air explosions, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;grenades, and nukes. Instant and anticipation variants, easy scaling, and stylized visuals for &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;PC and consoles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 19 ground explosions: 11 instant and 8 with anticipation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 14 air explosions: 8 instant and 6 with anticipation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Three grenade, two line, and three nuke effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Niagara GPU and mesh emitters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 42 textures, including noise, gradients, icons, flipbooks, and flares.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Four materials with 34 instances for distortion, erosion, Fresnel, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Eight meshes and two Blueprints included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="toonexplosions_vol1_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="toonexplosions_vol1_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/n8Vj3oz-cHE"&gt;Toon Explosions Vol.1 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring stylized action to life with 56 toon Niagara effects, including ground blasts, 360° explosions, &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;fire, and smoke. Easy to scale, with varied shapes and styles for PC and console games.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 18 ground and 10 full 360° explosion effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Eight circle and eight line effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Six fire and four smoke effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- One cone and one grenade effect.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Niagara GPU and mesh emitters.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 51 textures and four materials with 42 instances.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Materials featuring distortion, erosion, Fresnel, and more.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Five meshes and one Blueprint included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="magicprojectiles_vol4_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="magicprojectiles_vol4_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/cvMDESS-usI"&gt;Magic Projectiles Vol.4 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enhance your combat with 50 Niagara projectiles across 17 unique designs, including spells, arrows, shurikens,&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; cards, and shards. Mix and match projectiles, muzzles, and impacts, with easy scale and color adjustments.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Varied projectile styles for magical and weapon-based attacks.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Combine muzzle, impact, and projectile effects for custom results.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Easily adjust effect size and color.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Suitable for multiple characters, genres, and art styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Effects designed for all platforms.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Plugin Note: Niagara and Niagara Extras may need to be enabled.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lootdrops_vol2_niagara"&gt;&lt;a id="lootdrops_vol2_niagara" href="https://youtu.be/zFqEIQsEi54"&gt;Loot Drops Vol.2 - Niagara&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make rewards stand out with 10 unique loot drop designs, each with 6 rarity levels, for 60 effect variations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Easy to scale and suitable for PC and mobile, across varied genres and art styles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 18 circular loot drop effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Six cylinder and six rift effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- 30 vertical loot drop effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Six rarity levels per design to distinguish item tiers.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Demo scene, textures, and materials included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="steampunkzeppelinstation"&gt;&lt;a id="steampunkzeppelinstation" href="https://youtu.be/IOZVaSgyhl4"&gt;Steampunk Zeppelin Station&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.0–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a grand steampunk skyport with complete terminal interiors, exterior airship docks, and modular Victorian architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Detailed automatons, industrial machinery, atmospheric effects, Lumen lighting &amp;amp; a showcase level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular arches, wall panels, façades, platforms, scaffolding, and boarding walkways.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Zeppelin docking structures, mooring masts, and loading cranes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Detailed humanoid robot props for ticket counters and cargo bays.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Mechanical-style departure board and ornate wooden ticket booth.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Moving floor gears, gauges, pipes, valves, and iron railings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Baggage carts, vintage trunks, and suitcases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Steam, smoke, fog, god rays, and weathering decals.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Multiple lighting scenarios managed through sublevels.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Asset Overlap: Includes all meshes from the Steampunk Zeppelin Station interior-only pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="steampunkmodularcafeenvironment"&gt;&lt;a id="steampunkmodularcafeenvironment" href="https://youtu.be/qwTupckaJoQ"&gt;Steampunk Modular Cafe Environment&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fab Professional License Redeem Code | Unreal Engine 5.5–5.8&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a cozy steampunk café with modular Victorian interiors, a steam-powered &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;espresso machine, and decorative service robots.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Detailed industrial props, PBR materials, Lumen lighting, and a complete showcase level.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Features:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Modular furniture, bar counters, and interior construction pieces.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Victorian architecture with large industrial arched windows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Copper boilers, brass gears, valves, gauges, and pipes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Decorative robots, clocks, lighting fixtures, and café accessories.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Customizable layouts that are easy to rearrange and expand.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Warm cinematic lighting and high-quality PBR materials.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;- Optimized for Unreal Engine 5, with a demonstration level included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
