      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/2d962a6f0126ba4995db31e3da9adfbb34ad5424.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=217b9dc27637c1eb238964cd33023940"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/525bf8d4c24dc3a45f3763557a584f9f08542528.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=ac1f534a4d9e5f04bca48860bed29a2a"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Build your world with Unity&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Make video games that look like they took years to design—in no time at all! With this massive collection of tools and assets for Unity, you can fill your games with detail and atmosphere and have them ready to play before you know it. Build complete game worlds with ready-to-use characters, environments, biomes, and props. Explore collections of terrain and environment stamps, design ready-to-use industrial cityscapes, experiment with dynamic lighting and fog effects, and more! Create, experiment, prototype, and bring your ideas to life with a wide variety of production-ready Unity assets, many of which have never been featured in a Humble Bundle before! Get this huge bundle of assets for the price of your choosing, and support the Make-A-Wish Foundation with your purchase!  &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. Please redeem your keys before October 31, 2027. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infinitunesmusiccollectiona_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;InfiniTUNES Music Collection A - Medieval Real Instrument Songs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernalking"&gt;Infernal King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#switchinputdeviceandgamepadmouse"&gt;Switch Input Device &amp; Gamepad Mouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#boardgamespack"&gt;Board Games Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcadevehicleai"&gt;Arcade Vehicle Ai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcadebikephysics"&gt;Arcade Bike Physics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ikarus_gameviewcontroller"&gt;IKARUS: Game View Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infinitunesmusiccollectionb_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;InfiniTUNES Music Collection B - Medieval Real Instrument Songs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#particlestabilizer"&gt;Particle Stabilizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hellbornwarlord"&gt;Hellborn Warlord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#skullbearer"&gt;The Skull Bearer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#forestlake"&gt;ForestLake&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#researchship"&gt;Research Ship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiabiomesspawnerpack_vividarts"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Vivid Arts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#utilitytools_pack1"&gt;Utility Tools - Pack 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sci-fimegacity"&gt;Sci-Fi MegaCity&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#focus_taskmanager"&gt;Focus - Task Manager&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcademonstertrucks"&gt;Arcade Monster Trucks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#luminagihdrp_real-timevoxelglobalillumination"&gt;LUMINA GI HDRP: Real-Time Voxel Global Illumination&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#particledynamicmagicurpultimate_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines"&gt;Particle Dynamic Magic URP ULTIMATE - Decals, Particles, Radiosity &amp; Splines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tooneffectsmakerurp_animeandcartoonfx"&gt;Toon Effects Maker URP - Anime &amp; Cartoon FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infiniriver_fluidbasedwatersimulator"&gt;InfiniRIVER - Fluid based water simulator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infinitreepro_proceduralforestcreationandoptimization"&gt;InfiniTREE PRO - Procedural Forest Creation &amp; Optimization&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#particledynamicmagic2_decalsplineaiparticlesanddynamics"&gt;Particle Dynamic Magic 2: Decal, Spline, AI Particles &amp; dynamics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#advancedfxcreator_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines"&gt;Advanced FX Creator - Decals, Particles, Radiosity &amp; Splines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#giblion_anime-npr-toonscenegenerationframework"&gt;GIBLION: Anime-NPR-Toon Scene Generation Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#globalilluminationproxy"&gt;Global Illumination Proxy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#tooneffectsmaker_specialfxcreationandcontrol"&gt;Toon Effects Maker: Special FX creation &amp; control&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#oceanis2021prourpwaterframework"&gt;Oceanis 2021 Pro URP Water Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#oceanisprobirpwaterframework"&gt;Oceanis Pro BiRP Water Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infiniglassurp_densitybasedrefractionsandsubsurfacescattering"&gt;InfiniGLASS URP - Density based refractions and Subsurface scattering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#volumetricfogsrp"&gt;Volumetric Fog SRP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#nunandpossessednun_dualformcharacter"&gt;Nun / Possessed Nun - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#butcherandswinebrute_dualformcharacter"&gt;Butcher / Swine Brute - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernaldestroyer"&gt;Infernal Destroyer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernalarchmage"&gt;Infernal Archmage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernalvoidheart"&gt;Infernal Voidheart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#infernaldeathknight"&gt;Infernal DeathKnight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#littledemonandhellbrute_dualformcharacter"&gt;Little Demon / Hell Brute - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#maskedbunny_hunter"&gt;The Masked Bunny - Hunter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#maskedbunny_huntress"&gt;The Masked Bunny - Huntress&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#house-furniture"&gt;House- Furniture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#rockydesert"&gt;RockyDesert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#deepunderwater"&gt;Deep Underwater&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#adventureandsurvival_male"&gt;Adventure / Survival - Male&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#lookouttowerprops"&gt;Lookout Tower (Props)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#abandonedcitybus_drivable"&gt;Abandoned City Bus - Drivable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiabiomesspawnerpack_polyartstudio"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Polyart Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiabiomesspawnerpack_sicsgames"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - SICS Games&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiabiomesspawnerpack_staggartcreations"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Staggart Creations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiabiomesspawnerpack_baldinoboy"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Baldinoboy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modernsupermarket"&gt;Modern Supermarket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modernlaboratory"&gt;Modern Laboratory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#oldindustry"&gt;Old Industry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dungeoncrawlergridcontroller"&gt;Dungeon Crawler Grid Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#loveandhate"&gt;Love/Hate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ashmonstertruckphysics"&gt;Ash Monster Truck Physics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#arcadedamagesystem"&gt;Arcade Damage System&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gaiaforunity6"&gt;Gaia for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#pegasus_flythroughsforunity6"&gt;Pegasus - Flythroughs for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#ambientsounds_interactivesoundscapesforunity6"&gt;Ambient Sounds - Interactive Soundscapes for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#megastampbundle"&gt;Mega Stamp Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="infinitunesmusiccollectiona_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;&lt;a id="infinitunesmusiccollectiona_medievalrealinstrumentsongs" href="https://youtu.be/ga-G7kb2LF4"&gt;InfiniTUNES Music Collection A - Medieval Real Instrument Songs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add medieval-inspired real-instrument music to your Unity projects with InfiniTUNES Music Collection A. The collection contains music tracks that can be played directly or rearranged through their individual instrument tracks, giving you different possibilities for combining the music.  The tracks are based on real instruments and are composed by Theodore Tsoukalas of the ARTnGAME team. The included InfiniTUNE system can combine individual tracks and control their volume, allowing different combinations of the available music parts.  Use the tracks individually or experiment with the instrument layers to create different musical arrangements for your scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernalking"&gt;&lt;a id="infernalking" href="https://youtu.be/7JJ9RX4A0Xc"&gt;Infernal King&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Rule the underworld with Infernal King, a powerful skeletal demon character designed for fantasy, action, horror, and RPG projects. Featuring an imposing infernal design, detailed PBR materials, a dedicated weapon, and a commanding presence, this character is ideal for powerful enemies, elite warriors, and memorable boss encounters.     HIGHLIGHTS      Infernal Design – Powerful skeletal demon character  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Designed for combat and battle sequences   Boss Character – Perfect for major enemy encounters   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation   Skeletal Design – Detailed fantasy creature appearance  ️ PBR Materials – Realistic materials for detailed visuals   Game Ready – Suitable for real-time gameplay   Versatile Use – Great for Action, Fantasy, Horror &amp;amp; RPG projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="switchinputdeviceandgamepadmouse"&gt;&lt;a id="switchinputdeviceandgamepadmouse" href="https://youtu.be/pMw72cPPXTQ"&gt;Switch Input Device &amp; Gamepad Mouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a smoother cross-platform input experience with Switch Input Device &amp;amp; Gamepad Mouse. This Unity tool helps detect and switch between input devices at runtime, making it easier to build interfaces that adapt to different controllers and input methods. Designed for projects using gamepads, mouse controls, and modern UI systems.     HIGHLIGHTS      Device Switching – Detect and switch between input devices   Gamepad Support – Designed for controller-based gameplay  ️ Gamepad Mouse – Use gamepad input for mouse-style interaction   Input Detection – Identify active runtime input devices  ️ UI Controls – Adapt interfaces to different input methods  ⚙️ Runtime Input – Manage device changes during gameplay   Cross Platform – Useful for multi-platform projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="boardgamespack"&gt;&lt;a id="boardgamespack"&gt;Board Games Pack&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b96146504dc0b8a0ba57a7930a5824376aeb31b0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=2f89b3100aca6e6354e50e4ae1d4f27d"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add a collection of board-game and tabletop-themed 3D props to your Unity project with Board Games Pack. The pack covers a range of classic games and gaming elements, including chess, backgammon, dominoes, cards, dice, Tic-Tac-Toe, Battleship, solitaire, and casino-related objects.     HIGHLIGHTS     ♟️ Chess – Chess pieces and related elements   Backgammon – Backgammon-related elements   Domino – Domino game elements   Cards – Playing card elements   Tic-Tac-Toe – Tic-Tac-Toe-related elements   Battleship – Battleship game elements   Solitaire – Solitaire-related elements   Casino – Casino-themed elements   Coins – Coin-related props   Dice – Dice elements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="arcadevehicleai"&gt;&lt;a id="arcadevehicleai" href="https://youtu.be/ctYtb-kAd1U"&gt;Arcade Vehicle Ai&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt; Bring arcade-style vehicle AI into your Unity project!    Arcade Vehicle AI is designed to help you implement AI-controlled vehicles with an arcade-style approach. It can be used for vehicle AI behavior in racing and other vehicle-based gameplay, giving you a straightforward starting point for adding AI-driven vehicles to your project.    ⚙️ The tool focuses on arcade vehicle AI and is built to work alongside vehicle-based projects. Whether you are working on a racing game or experimenting with AI-controlled cars, this asset provides a simple way to add vehicle AI behavior to your Unity workflow.     Build your vehicle gameplay around the AI system and customize it according to the needs of your project.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="arcadebikephysics"&gt;&lt;a id="arcadebikephysics" href="https://youtu.be/3SEM8gjb-ck"&gt;Arcade Bike Physics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Ready to add arcade-style bike gameplay to your Unity project?    Arcade Bike Physics is a mobile-friendly tool with a quick setup workflow. Simply provide references for the bike body and wheels, then set up your bike and start working with the included movement logic.     The asset can be used for arcade bike games such as bike fights, bike shooting, or simple racing games with collectables and throwables. You can build additional functionality around the movement system according to your project needs.     The package also includes an animation system for the bike rider with Inverse Kinematics.    The code is documented and designed to be easy to modify, making it a practical starting point for arcade bike gameplay in Unity. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt15"&gt;Pay $15 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="ikarus_gameviewcontroller"&gt;&lt;a id="ikarus_gameviewcontroller" href="https://youtu.be/vfseIZAdzDU"&gt;IKARUS: Game View Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Preview and control your Unity Game View directly while working in the editor with IKARUS! The tool was created to help preview scenes using the actual game view while adjusting the camera and lighting without entering Play Mode.  Control the Main Camera using fly-through modes and adjust the main Sun Directional Light, including its position, rotation and intensity. You can also toggle the scene's Volume FX while previewing. ✨ IKARUS is designed around direct Game View control, helping you explore your scene from the perspective of the final camera while making adjustments inside the Unity Editor.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infinitunesmusiccollectionb_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;&lt;a id="infinitunesmusiccollectionb_medievalrealinstrumentsongs"&gt;InfiniTUNES Music Collection B - Medieval Real Instrument Songs&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/65b50621c904fce8083c5f1e90d7c8ed1512acb5.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=898d186a361eca8f9baac39b9cdd7e00"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore another collection of medieval real-instrument music with InfiniTUNES Collection B. The package contains music tracks that can be played directly or rearranged using their individual instrument tracks, giving you different ways to combine the available music.  The music is composed by Theodore Tsoukalas of the ARTnGAME team and is based on real instruments. The included InfiniTUNE system can combine individual tracks and control their volume, allowing you to create different combinations and moods from the available music parts.  Use the tracks as they are or experiment with the separate instrument layers to build your own musical arrangements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="particlestabilizer"&gt;&lt;a id="particlestabilizer" href="https://youtu.be/KistBJVTxk4"&gt;Particle Stabilizer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;✨ Keep particle effects under control with Particle Stabilizer, a tool focused on stabilizing and managing particle behavior in Unity. The package is designed for working with particle systems and provides functionality aimed at maintaining more controlled particle movement. ️ Use it as part of your particle-effect workflow when creating visual effects that require more consistent behavior. Particle Stabilizer fits into the broader ARTnGAME collection of particle and visual-effect tools, giving you another utility for working with particle-based effects directly inside Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="hellbornwarlord"&gt;&lt;a id="hellbornwarlord" href="https://youtu.be/Lc8rAFUCXtc"&gt;Hellborn Warlord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Command the battlefield with Hellborn Warlord, a powerful infernal character created for dark fantasy, action, horror, and RPG games. Featuring a menacing demon-inspired design, detailed PBR materials, a distinctive weapon, and a powerful presence, this character can serve as a formidable enemy, elite warrior, or boss character in your game.     HIGHLIGHTS      Hellborn Design – Detailed demon-inspired fantasy warrior  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Equipped with a distinctive combat weapon   Boss Ready – Ideal for powerful enemies and boss encounters   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation   Detailed Character – Realistic skeletal and creature elements  ️ PBR Materials – High-quality materials for realistic visuals   Game Ready – Created for real-time gameplay applications   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="skullbearer"&gt;&lt;a id="skullbearer" href="https://youtu.be/Z9d_LHw4r7o"&gt;The Skull Bearer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring a dark and intimidating presence to your game with The Skull Bearer. This detailed fantasy character is designed for developers creating horror, action, RPG, and dark fantasy experiences. With a distinctive skeletal design, weapon, realistic PBR materials, facial blendshapes, and a strong boss-like appearance, The Skull Bearer can become a memorable enemy or powerful character within your game world.     HIGHLIGHTS     ☠️ Distinctive Design – Menacing skeletal fantasy character  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Ready for combat-focused gameplay   Enemy &amp;amp; Boss Ready – Perfect for powerful encounters   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed materials for realistic rendering   Game Ready – Designed for real-time gameplay   Modular Character – Flexible setup for customization   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="forestlake"&gt;&lt;a id="forestlake" href="https://youtu.be/zLd7TPTZT8Q"&gt;ForestLake&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a pine forest environment with trees, vegetation, rocks, water and terrain elements.    ForestLake includes a 2 x 2 km demo map with a lake and river, giving you a natural setting to explore and build around. Vegetation and trees include wind effects, while LODs and billboards are provided for vegetation.    The pack also features fully dynamic lighting, customized materials, and LOD and lightmap UVs for the included assets.    With its forest landscape, water elements and vegetation setup, ForestLake provides the main environment pieces for creating a detailed pine forest scene.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="researchship"&gt;&lt;a id="researchship" href="https://youtu.be/yusso2C14iQ"&gt;Research Ship&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore a 122-meter-long research vessel filled with ship equipment, cargo and environment props.    Research Ship includes a diving capsule, cargo containers, hangar, large crane, transition room and various additional props. The vessel contains over 100 unique objects and is designed around a detailed research and ocean-going ship setting.    The pack features customized materials, with new and aged looks created using vertex paint. Lightmap UVs and LODs are also included for the assets.    Please note that the ship does not include a complete interior.    Build your own scenes around the vessel, equipment and props included in the pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_vividarts"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_vividarts" href="https://youtu.be/WViQ5EpTk7o"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Vivid Arts&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Integrate Vivid Arts nature and environment assets into your Gaia workflow with a dedicated spawner setup. This pack provides Gaia spawners configured for compatible Vivid Arts assets, making them suitable for use within Gaia terrain, biome, and procedural environment workflows.      HIGHLIGHTS       Gaia Integration – Designed for use with Gaia    Vivid Arts – Configured for compatible Vivid Arts assets    Spawner Integration – Gaia spawners for the supported asset collection   ⚙️ Procedural Workflow – Use supported assets within Gaia’s spawning system   ️ Biome Workflow – Suitable for Gaia terrain and biome setups    Asset Integration – Connects Vivid Arts assets with Gaia workflows &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="utilitytools_pack1"&gt;&lt;a id="utilitytools_pack1" href="https://youtu.be/MsHeP_H_r3c"&gt;Utility Tools - Pack 1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Speed up your Unity Editor workflow with Utility Tools - Pack 1, a collection of practical tools designed to make everyday level design and GameObject management faster and easier. From inspecting object statistics to replacing objects, sorting GameObjects, and correcting transforms, these utilities help reduce repetitive editor tasks and keep your scenes organized.    ️ HIGHLIGHTS ️     GameObject Stats – Quickly inspect mesh, vertex and triangle information   Object Replacer – Replace objects or prefabs efficiently   Sort Objects – Organize GameObjects by name or transform   Transform Correction – Quickly fix and manage transforms   Editor Utilities – Practical tools for everyday workflows  ⚡ Workflow Focused – Reduce repetitive editor tasks   Unity Editor – Designed for Unity development workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sci-fimegacity"&gt;&lt;a id="sci-fimegacity" href="https://youtu.be/pUKdzoggIDE"&gt;Sci-Fi MegaCity&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;"Create a futuristic city environment with Sci-Fi MegaCity. This 3D environment pack focuses on futuristic and science-fiction city themes, with references to cyberpunk, Neo-Tokyo, skyscrapers, suburbs, and futuristic urban settings.  HIGHLIGHTS   Futuristic City – Futuristic urban environment ️ City – City-focused environment  Skyscrapers – Tall futuristic city structures  Cyberpunk – Cyberpunk-inspired theme  Neo-Tokyo – Neo-Tokyo-inspired setting  Sci-Fi – Science-fiction environment ️ Suburb – Suburban city elements  Future – Futuristic world setting "&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="focus_taskmanager"&gt;&lt;a id="focus_taskmanager" href="https://youtu.be/NrIpuxlO4Ow"&gt;Focus - Task Manager&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt; Keep your Unity development tasks organized with Focus - Task Manager!     Focus is an editor tool designed around productivity, task management, and project organization. Create and manage tasks using Kanban boards, organize them with customizable columns, and keep your workflow in one place.     ⚡ Need to quickly capture an idea? Use the task capture shortcut to create a task quickly. You can also attach Unity-related items such as GameObjects, prefabs, scenes, and scripts to cards for easier access.      Search and filter your tasks with real-time search and customizable filters, while undo/redo support helps you manage changes.      Built with game development workflows in mind, Focus can help organize tasks, bugs, sprints, and content-related work directly inside Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="arcademonstertrucks"&gt;&lt;a id="arcademonstertrucks" href="https://youtu.be/QEs5Gv9OED0"&gt;Arcade Monster Trucks&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt; Add a collection of arcade-style monster trucks to your Unity project!     Arcade Monster Trucks is a 3D model pack featuring 15 unique monster trucks with a low-poly art style. The vehicles are designed for Monster Truck-based games featuring jumps, flips, tricks, Monster Truck fights, or simple racing gameplay.      Each vehicle uses around 5,000–6,000 triangles, with a total geometry count of around 82K triangles across the pack.      The pack includes 15 base textures, with each texture sized at 512×512.     Whether you're building a racing scene, stunt gameplay, or a Monster Truck-focused project, these vehicles give you a collection of different trucks to work with. &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="luminagihdrp_real-timevoxelglobalillumination"&gt;&lt;a id="luminagihdrp_real-timevoxelglobalillumination" href="https://youtu.be/F3ZJtszWhXY"&gt;LUMINA GI HDRP: Real-Time Voxel Global Illumination&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring real-time voxel-based global illumination to your HDRP scenes with LUMINA GI! The system focuses on real-time indirect lighting using a voxel-based approach, with support for global illumination, ambient occlusion, reflections and other lighting effects.  It works with HDRP and includes support for sun and mesh-shaped light sources, allowing you to experiment with dynamic lighting across your environments. The system is designed around real-time scene lighting rather than traditional baked GI workflows, giving you a flexible way to explore indirect illumination while working directly inside Unity. ✨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="particledynamicmagicurpultimate_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines"&gt;&lt;a id="particledynamicmagicurpultimate_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines" href="https://youtu.be/WB632DjhjG8"&gt;Particle Dynamic Magic URP ULTIMATE - Decals, Particles, Radiosity &amp; Splines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;✨ Create and manipulate dynamic particles, decals and spline-based effects with Particle Dynamic Magic URP ULTIMATE! Build effects using particles, mesh emission, splines, decals and different forces such as gravity, turbulence and vortexes.  The package brings together particle manipulation, dynamic decals, spline particles and other visual effects in one framework. Create effects from meshes, images and other sources, then combine different systems to create your own visual setups. ️ With tools for particles, decals, splines and dynamic effects, you can experiment with a wide range of VFX directly inside Unity's URP workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tooneffectsmakerurp_animeandcartoonfx"&gt;&lt;a id="tooneffectsmakerurp_animeandcartoonfx" href="https://youtu.be/oh9wMYR8vKg"&gt;Toon Effects Maker URP - Anime &amp; Cartoon FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create stylized visual effects with Toon Effects Maker URP, a framework focused on cartoon and anime-style effects in Unity. ✨ Build effects using the included Effect Maker, particle tools, aura effects, beams, projectile effects, sprite-sheet generation and motion recording. The package also includes a library of 200+ pre-made effects that can be used directly or as a starting point for your own creations. ⚡ Explore effects such as lightning, tornadoes, ground cracks, waterfalls, dissolves and toon-style lighting. A Toon Ocean system is also included for creating dynamic ocean, water, ice or lava effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infiniriver_fluidbasedwatersimulator"&gt;&lt;a id="infiniriver_fluidbasedwatersimulator" href="https://youtu.be/B6M9X3apdcI"&gt;InfiniRIVER - Fluid based water simulator&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create flowing water effects with InfiniRIVER, a fluid-based water simulator for Unity. The framework focuses on interactive water and river-style effects, with features related to water flow, ripples, caustics, refraction and planar reflections.  Work with flow maps and explore different water-based setups for rivers, liquids and other flowing environments. The system also includes particle-related functionality and can be used for different fluid visuals such as water or lava.  With support across Built-in, URP and HDRP compatibility listed on the store page, InfiniRIVER provides a dedicated toolkit for experimenting with dynamic fluid environments in Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infinitreepro_proceduralforestcreationandoptimization"&gt;&lt;a id="infinitreepro_proceduralforestcreationandoptimization" href="https://youtu.be/fql6-TNY6zc"&gt;InfiniTREE PRO - Procedural Forest Creation &amp; Optimization&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build forests and vegetation setups with InfiniTREE PRO! This procedural forest creation and optimization tool focuses on trees, plants, grass and foliage while providing features for procedural generation and performance optimization.  Create vegetation using procedural tree tools and work with elements such as leaves, plants and forest environments. The package also includes functionality related to tree cutting and chopping, allowing trees to interact with these actions.  With support for Built-in, URP and HDRP listed on the store page, InfiniTREE PRO brings procedural vegetation creation and forest-related tools together inside Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="particledynamicmagic2_decalsplineaiparticlesanddynamics"&gt;&lt;a id="particledynamicmagic2_decalsplineaiparticlesanddynamics" href="https://youtu.be/H65iUNcG9XU"&gt;Particle Dynamic Magic 2: Decal, Spline, AI Particles &amp; dynamics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;✨ Build dynamic particle, decal and spline effects with Particle Dynamic Magic 2! The framework combines particle manipulation, dynamic decals, spline tools and AI particle features for creating interactive visual effects.  Particles can be created from splines, images, meshes and other sources, while forces such as gravity, turbulence, vortexes and attraction can be used to control their behavior. The package also includes dynamic decals, ribbons, grass effects, particle shields and a large collection of ready-made effects. ️ With editor and runtime controls, you can combine different systems to create your own particle and gameplay effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="advancedfxcreator_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines"&gt;&lt;a id="advancedfxcreator_decalsparticlesradiosityandsplines" href="https://youtu.be/Qcu7ky0h5l8"&gt;Advanced FX Creator - Decals, Particles, Radiosity &amp; Splines&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create and control visual effects in Unity with Advanced FX Creator! The framework brings together decals, particles, mesh emission, splines, radiosity and other visual FX tools. ✨ Work with mesh particles, particle effects, ribbons and vortex-based effects while experimenting with different ways to manipulate your scene visuals. The spline system can be used as part of your effect creation workflow, while the included tools allow different visual elements to be combined together. ️ Whether you're working with particle-based visuals, mesh effects or spline-driven setups, Advanced FX Creator gives you a collection of tools for building custom effects directly inside Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="giblion_anime-npr-toonscenegenerationframework"&gt;&lt;a id="giblion_anime-npr-toonscenegenerationframework" href="https://youtu.be/KgHyMn8WUB4"&gt;GIBLION: Anime-NPR-Toon Scene Generation Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your Unity scenes an anime and non-photorealistic look with GIBLION! This framework focuses on NPR and toon-style scene generation, with tools and effects for creating stylized environments. ✏️ Explore features related to outlines, toon rendering, watercolor and pencil-style visuals, while working with elements such as toon water, clouds, rivers, tornadoes, grass and vegetation.  The framework also includes procedural and interactive elements that can be used when building stylized scenes. Whether you're creating a colorful environment or experimenting with anime-inspired rendering, GIBLION provides a collection of tools for developing a distinctive toon-style presentation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="globalilluminationproxy"&gt;&lt;a id="globalilluminationproxy" href="https://youtu.be/hxV9WZigsq8"&gt;Global Illumination Proxy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add dynamic global illumination to your Unity scenes with Global Illumination Proxy. The system is designed for real-time GI without traditional light baking and supports Unity light types such as point, spot and directional lights.  It also includes features such as second light bounces, image-based lighting and area-light proxy functionality. The Hero Follow mode can be used for open environments where the GI calculation follows the main character area. ✨ With its real-time approach and support for different lighting setups, Global Illumination Proxy provides a way to experiment with dynamic indirect lighting directly in Unity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="tooneffectsmaker_specialfxcreationandcontrol"&gt;&lt;a id="tooneffectsmaker_specialfxcreationandcontrol"&gt;Toon Effects Maker: Special FX creation &amp; control&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b68e5338ada353d3566a3fb313517ea120e3b064.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=58d84ec94d7951bf2847a338f8260309"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;✨ Create stylized special effects with Toon Effects Maker! This tool focuses on the creation and control of toon-style visual effects using particles and other effect systems.  Experiment with cartoon-inspired visuals, particle effects and different combinations of special FX elements to create your own setups. The package is designed around interactive effect creation and provides tools for building and controlling effects directly inside Unity. ⚡ Whether you're working on stylized gameplay effects or experimenting with cartoon-style visuals, Toon Effects Maker gives you a dedicated environment for creating and adjusting your own effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="oceanis2021prourpwaterframework"&gt;&lt;a id="oceanis2021prourpwaterframework" href="https://youtu.be/0KaJkhjX_R0"&gt;Oceanis 2021 Pro URP Water Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build detailed water and ocean environments with Oceanis 2021 Pro URP Water Framework. Designed for Unity's Universal Render Pipeline, the system focuses on ocean and water simulation with wave systems, water shading, reflections and underwater effects.  Explore features such as caustics, bubbles, foam, water vortices, floating objects and volumetric lighting. The framework also includes water-related effects for lakes and other environments.  With its combination of water movement, reflections and underwater visuals, Oceanis provides a collection of tools for creating ocean and water scenes within the URP workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="oceanisprobirpwaterframework"&gt;&lt;a id="oceanisprobirpwaterframework" href="https://youtu.be/8peB8OM0VD8"&gt;Oceanis Pro BiRP Water Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create water and ocean scenes in Unity's Built-in Render Pipeline with Oceanis Pro BiRP Water Framework. The system focuses on water simulation and visual effects, with features including ocean waves, foam, bubbles, caustics, water vortices and underwater effects.  It also includes support for floating objects and water-related lighting effects. The framework is designed specifically for the Built-in Render Pipeline, giving you tools for developing ocean and water environments within that workflow.  Combine the available water effects and settings to create different types of scenes, from open ocean environments to other liquid-based setups.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infiniglassurp_densitybasedrefractionsandsubsurfacescattering"&gt;&lt;a id="infiniglassurp_densitybasedrefractionsandsubsurfacescattering" href="https://youtu.be/tw91lo_H7J4"&gt;InfiniGLASS URP - Density based refractions and Subsurface scattering&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create glass and transparent material effects with InfiniGLASS URP! This shader system focuses on density-based refraction and subsurface scattering for Unity's Universal Render Pipeline. ✨ Experiment with effects such as depth-based refraction, volumetric transparency, density fading and refraction-based visuals. The package also includes support for caustics and transparent materials such as glass and diamond-style surfaces.  With its focus on refraction, transparency and subsurface scattering, InfiniGLASS provides tools for creating and adjusting glass-like visual effects directly within Unity's URP workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="volumetricfogsrp"&gt;&lt;a id="volumetricfogsrp" href="https://youtu.be/i463s0fPdvs"&gt;Volumetric Fog SRP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;️ Add volumetric fog effects to your Unity scenes with Volumetric Fog SRP. The system is designed for use with Post Processing Stack v2.0 and provides controls for height- and distance-based fog.  Choose between 2D and 3D noise models to create different fog appearances and experiment with dynamic wind and atmospheric scattering effects. The system also includes sun occlusion and experimental point-light coloration for additional control over the fog. ☀️ Volumetric Fog SRP can also work alongside the Sun Shafts SRP system, making it useful for creating atmospheric scenes with volumetric lighting effects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="nunandpossessednun_dualformcharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="nunandpossessednun_dualformcharacter" href="https://youtu.be/XCcmvvfSG-s"&gt;Nun / Possessed Nun - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Transform a mysterious figure into a terrifying possessed entity with this dual-form character. Designed for horror, fantasy, action, and RPG projects, the Nun / Possessed Nun combines a realistic character design with a dramatic possession transformation. Detailed PBR materials, facial blendshapes, and a modular setup make this character suitable for both gameplay and cinematic scenes.     HIGHLIGHTS     ⛪ Dual Form Character – Switch between Nun and Possessed forms   Possession Transformation – Create a striking supernatural transformation   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation   Modular Character – Customize the character setup for your project  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed materials for realistic rendering   Game Ready – Designed for real-time gameplay and cinematic scenes   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible   Versatile Use – Perfect for Horror, Fantasy, Action &amp;amp; RPG games&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="butcherandswinebrute_dualformcharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="butcherandswinebrute_dualformcharacter" href="https://youtu.be/_GqfXwMVoBo"&gt;Butcher / Swine Brute - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a terrifying enemy with Butcher / Swine Brute, a unique dual-form character built around a brutal transformation concept. Combining a sinister butcher appearance with a monstrous swine form, this character is ideal for horror, action, fantasy, and RPG projects. Its realistic design, blendshapes, animations, and modular structure provide plenty of flexibility for gameplay and cinematic applications.     HIGHLIGHTS      Dual Form Character – Butcher and Swine Brute forms in one asset   Monster Transformation – Designed around a terrifying creature transformation   Blendshapes – Supports expressive character animation   Animations – Ready for dynamic gameplay and cinematic sequences   Modular Setup – Flexible character components for customization  ️ Realistic Materials – Detailed visuals for immersive environments   Game Ready – Suitable for enemies, monsters and encounters   Versatile Use – Great for Horror, Action, Fantasy &amp;amp; RPG projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernaldestroyer"&gt;&lt;a id="infernaldestroyer" href="https://youtu.be/jGy_0mXUJrE"&gt;Infernal Destroyer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unleash destruction with Infernal Destroyer, a brutal skeletal demon created for intense fantasy, action, horror, and RPG experiences. Its imposing creature design, detailed PBR materials, powerful weapon, and intimidating appearance make it a strong choice for elite enemies, combat encounters, and boss battles.     HIGHLIGHTS      Brutal Infernal Design – Intimidating skeletal demon warrior  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Built for combat-focused characters   Enemy &amp;amp; Boss Ready – Ideal for challenging encounters   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed surfaces for realistic rendering   Game Ready – Designed for real-time gameplay   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernalarchmage"&gt;&lt;a id="infernalarchmage" href="https://youtu.be/Se1PnPXbR2g"&gt;Infernal Archmage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring dark magic to your fantasy world with Infernal Archmage, a powerful skeletal spellcaster designed for action, RPG, horror, and fantasy projects. With an imposing infernal appearance, detailed PBR materials, and a distinctive magical character design, this asset is well suited for powerful enemies, boss encounters, dark mages, and supernatural characters.     HIGHLIGHTS      Infernal Mage Design – Powerful skeletal fantasy spellcaster   Enemy &amp;amp; Boss Ready – Perfect for major magical encounters  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Designed for fantasy combat scenarios   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation  ️ PBR Materials – Realistic materials for detailed visuals   Game Ready – Created for real-time gameplay   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernalvoidheart"&gt;&lt;a id="infernalvoidheart" href="https://youtu.be/DOsTrrQTrRw"&gt;Infernal Voidheart&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enter the darkness with Infernal Voidheart, a sinister skeletal demon character created for dark fantasy, horror, action, and RPG games. Its mysterious infernal design, detailed PBR materials, distinctive weapon, and intimidating presence make it suitable for powerful enemies, elite creatures, and boss encounters.     HIGHLIGHTS      Infernal Character – Dark and intimidating skeletal demon design  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Ready for combat and battle scenarios   Enemy &amp;amp; Boss Ready – Designed for powerful encounters   ARKit Blendshapes – Supports expressive facial animation   Detailed Skeleton – Distinctive fantasy creature appearance  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed materials for realistic rendering   Game Ready – Suitable for real-time gameplay   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="infernaldeathknight"&gt;&lt;a id="infernaldeathknight" href="https://youtu.be/yNWEu0b2naI"&gt;Infernal DeathKnight&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Unleash a terrifying presence on the battlefield with Infernal Death Knight, a detailed game-ready character designed for dark fantasy, RPG, action, and horror projects. With its menacing skeletal design, powerful armor, detailed PBR materials, and distinctive weapon, this character is well suited for powerful enemies, elite warriors, and intimidating boss encounters.     HIGHLIGHTS      Detailed Character – Realistic infernal skeletal warrior design  ⚔️ Weapon Included – Equipped with a powerful signature weapon   ARKit Blendshapes – Ready for expressive facial animation   Humanoid Character – Suitable for animation and gameplay  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed textures and materials for realistic visuals   Enemy &amp;amp; Boss Ready – Perfect for powerful enemies and boss encounters   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible   Versatile Use – Great for Action, Fantasy, Horror &amp;amp; RPG projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="littledemonandhellbrute_dualformcharacter"&gt;&lt;a id="littledemonandhellbrute_dualformcharacter" href="https://youtu.be/AInM-aYeCu4"&gt;Little Demon / Hell Brute - Dual Form Character&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A high-quality game-ready character designed for developers looking for detailed visuals, flexibility, and real-time performance. This character features a fully rigged humanoid setup, realistic PBR materials, modular outfit components, and high-resolution textures for crisp surface detail. Built for a wide range of projects including Action RPGs, Horror games, Fantasy worlds, and cinematic experiences.     HIGHLIGHTS      Game-Ready Character – Ready to integrate into your Unity project   Modular Outfit – Easily customize and mix outfit components   Facial Expressions – ARKit-ready facial setup with custom expressions   Humanoid Rig – Compatible with Unity humanoid animations   Animations Included – Ready-to-use gameplay animations  ️ 4K Textures – High-resolution PBR textures for detailed visuals   Advanced Materials – Built-In, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible   Optimized – Balanced for quality and real-time performance&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="maskedbunny_hunter"&gt;&lt;a id="maskedbunny_hunter" href="https://youtu.be/BxnnMxPc06M"&gt;The Masked Bunny - Hunter&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A high-quality, game-ready masked hunter character designed for action, horror, fantasy, and RPG projects. Featuring a detailed realistic design, modular outfit, PBR materials, and a fully rigged humanoid setup, The Masked Bunny - Hunter is ready to bring a unique and intimidating character to your game.     HIGHLIGHTS      Unique Character Design – Distinctive masked bunny-themed hunter   Modular Outfit – Separate components for easy customization   Facial Expressions – ARKit-compatible blendshapes for expressive characters   Humanoid Rig – Ready for Unity’s humanoid animation system  ️ 4K PBR Textures – High-resolution textures for detailed visuals  ⚔️ Game Ready – Optimized and ready for real-time gameplay   Render Pipeline Support – Compatible with Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP   Versatile Use – Perfect for Action, Horror, Fantasy, RPG &amp;amp; Adventure games&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="maskedbunny_huntress"&gt;&lt;a id="maskedbunny_huntress" href="https://youtu.be/EhTqJRElfws"&gt;The Masked Bunny - Huntress&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring a mysterious and deadly presence to your game with The Masked Bunny - Huntress, a detailed game-ready character created for action, horror, fantasy, and RPG projects. Her distinctive masked design combines a unique visual identity with realistic PBR materials and a flexible modular setup, making her suitable for both gameplay and cinematic scenes.     HIGHLIGHTS      Unique Character Design – Distinctive masked bunny-themed huntress   Modular Setup – Customize and combine character components easily   ARKit Blendshapes – Ready for expressive facial animation   Humanoid Rig – Designed for Unity’s humanoid animation system  ️ PBR Materials – Detailed materials for realistic rendering  ⚔️ Game Ready – Suitable for real-time gameplay and cinematic use   Render Pipeline Support – Built-in, URP &amp;amp; HDRP compatible   Versatile Character – Great for Action, Horror, Fantasy, RPG &amp;amp; Adventure projects  &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="house-furniture"&gt;&lt;a id="house-furniture" href="https://youtu.be/lr2UWpsMKwY"&gt;House- Furniture&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a fully decorated house with a detailed collection of furniture, interior elements and street props.    This pack includes a complete house featuring a bedroom, cabinet, two bathrooms, attic, child room and a large living room with kitchen. The modular exterior and interior setup lets you work with the house and its individual elements, while separate doors and drawers add more detail to the interiors.    Explore worn and clean demo levels, day and night lighting, two empty houses ready for decoration, background house meshes for the neighborhood, road and street props, and over 300 unique objects.    The pack also includes customized materials and high quality textures for building your own residential scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="rockydesert"&gt;&lt;a id="rockydesert" href="https://youtu.be/wbpHwd7bVQM"&gt;RockyDesert&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a rocky desert environment filled with rocks, desert foliage and detailed terrain.    RockyDesert includes a 765 x 765 m terrain designed around a dry desert landscape, with a collection of rocks and desert vegetation ready to be placed throughout the scene.    The pack includes LODs and lightmap UVs, fully dynamic lighting and customized materials. Terrain tessellation is also included for the Built-in Render Pipeline.    Use the included environment elements to build rocky desert landscapes with varied terrain, rocks and foliage while keeping the setup focused on the desert theme.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="deepunderwater"&gt;&lt;a id="deepunderwater" href="https://youtu.be/bkry0m695EA"&gt;Deep Underwater&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Take your scene beneath the surface with an underwater environment featuring terrain, rocks, vegetation and a sunken submarine.    Deep Underwater includes a 765 x 765 m example map designed around an underwater setting. The environment combines terrain with underwater elements and a collection of assets for building your own submerged scenes.    The pack includes fully customized materials, new and aged looks using vertex paint, LODs and lightmap UVs, along with terrain tessellation.    With its underwater terrain and environment assets, Deep Underwater gives you a complete starting point for creating scenes beneath the water.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="adventureandsurvival_male"&gt;&lt;a id="adventureandsurvival_male" href="https://youtu.be/KDJSYwsA734"&gt;Adventure / Survival - Male&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create an adventure or survival character with a modular design and a collection of equipment and props.    This male character includes customized materials, ARKit blendshapes and a rigged backpack using three additional bones. The pack also includes a rifle, pistol, hunting rifle and a set of props to complement the character.    A demo map is included to showcase the character and its assets. Custom shaders are provided for the supported render pipelines, while the character has a listed height of 185 cm.    The pack also includes LODs for the props, giving you a collection of character and equipment assets ready to be used in adventure and survival scenes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="lookouttowerprops"&gt;&lt;a id="lookouttowerprops" href="https://youtu.be/TE5z-Fya35g"&gt;Lookout Tower (Props)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build and detail a lookout tower scene with a dedicated collection of tower-themed props.    This pack includes the tower mesh along with more than 100 lookout-themed props, giving you a range of objects to populate and detail your scene.    The included materials can be adjusted for a worn look, while high quality textures add detail to the assets. Lightmap UVs are also included.    The pack is focused on the lookout tower and its surrounding props, making it easy to create and customize a lookout-themed scene. If you are looking for a complete forest environment together with the tower, the store page also points to the separate Lookout Tower Pack.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="abandonedcitybus_drivable"&gt;&lt;a id="abandonedcitybus_drivable" href="https://youtu.be/rQURJ1Tp3gs"&gt;Abandoned City Bus - Drivable&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Add an abandoned city bus to your scene with drivable functionality and multiple worn-out variations.    The pack includes a drivable bus with simple character controllers, along with clean, worn, moss, burnt and destroyed looks. Individual parts can be opened, while the included car randomizer allows the bus to be used in drivable or static setups.    Explore the detailed engine and interior, separate glass and included LODs. The bus uses a generic design without real-world brands or logos.    Custom shaders are included for the supported render pipelines, and the asset supports Realistic Car Controller Pro, Ash Vehicle Physics and NWH Vehicles.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_polyartstudio"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_polyartstudio" href="https://youtu.be/JKrKrsDinKk"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Polyart Studio&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Enhance your Gaia workflow with a dedicated spawner integration for Polyart Studio nature and environment assets. This pack provides Gaia spawners configured for compatible Polyart Studio assets, allowing you to bring them into Gaia-based terrain and biome workflows with an organized and streamlined setup.     HIGHLIGHTS      Gaia Integration – Designed for use with Gaia   Polyart Studio – Configured for compatible Polyart Studio assets   Spawner Integration – Gaia spawners for the supported asset collection  ⚙️ Procedural Workflow – Use supported assets within Gaia’s spawning system  ️ Biome Workflow – Suitable for Gaia terrain and biome setups   Asset Integration – Connects Polyart Studio assets with Gaia workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_sicsgames"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_sicsgames" href="https://youtu.be/l-z1K0-xVAs"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - SICS Games&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Expand your Gaia environment workflow with a dedicated spawner integration for SICS Games nature and environment assets. This pack provides Gaia spawners configured for compatible SICS Games assets, making them easier to use within Gaia terrain, biome, and procedural environment workflows.     HIGHLIGHTS      Gaia Integration – Designed for use with Gaia   SICS Games – Configured for compatible SICS Games assets   Spawner Integration – Gaia spawners for the supported asset collection  ⚙️ Procedural Workflow – Use supported assets with Gaia’s spawning system  ️ Biome Workflow – Suitable for Gaia terrain and biome setups   Asset Integration – Connects SICS Games assets with Gaia workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_staggartcreations"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_staggartcreations" href="https://youtu.be/ZCAwEyWLbUk"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Staggart Creations&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring Staggart Creations nature and environment assets into your Gaia workflow with this dedicated spawner integration. The pack provides Gaia spawners configured for compatible Staggart Creations assets, helping you incorporate them into Gaia-based terrain, biome, and procedural environment workflows.     HIGHLIGHTS      Gaia Integration – Designed for use with Gaia   Staggart Creations – Configured for compatible Staggart Creations assets   Spawner Integration – Gaia spawners for the supported asset collection  ⚙️ Procedural Workflow – Use supported assets within Gaia’s spawning system  ️ Biome Workflow – Suitable for Gaia terrain and biome setups   Asset Integration – Connects Staggart Creations assets with Gaia workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_baldinoboy"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiabiomesspawnerpack_baldinoboy" href="https://youtu.be/1lo8kqDAFi4"&gt;Gaia Biomes Spawner Pack - Baldinoboy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Integrate Baldinoboy nature and environment assets into your Gaia workflow with this dedicated spawner pack. It provides Gaia spawners configured for compatible Baldinoboy assets, allowing them to be used within Gaia terrain, biome, and procedural environment workflows.     HIGHLIGHTS      Gaia Integration – Designed for use with Gaia   Baldinoboy – Configured for compatible Baldinoboy assets   Spawner Integration – Gaia spawners for the supported asset collection  ⚙️ Procedural Workflow – Use supported assets with Gaia’s spawning system  ️ Biome Workflow – Suitable for Gaia terrain and biome setups   Asset Integration – Connects Baldinoboy assets with Gaia workflows&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modernsupermarket"&gt;&lt;a id="modernsupermarket"&gt;Modern Supermarket&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9667f5b49b3c5db767335939d9768e7881bf96c2.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=03c147e2d08fd683b9ef9d8513fba3c5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a modern supermarket environment with this detailed 3D asset pack. Modern Supermarket focuses on the everyday products and areas found in a grocery store, with a variety of elements related to food, drinks, kitchen items, storage, dairy, meat, frozen products, and more.     HIGHLIGHTS      Drinks – Cola, soda and other beverage-related elements   Alcohol – Wine and other alcohol-related products   Food – Various food and grocery elements   Dairy – Dairy-related supermarket products   Meat – Meat-related grocery elements  ❄️ Frozen – Frozen food and products   Kitchen – Kitchen-related elements   Store – Supermarket and shop environment elements&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="modernlaboratory"&gt;&lt;a id="modernlaboratory"&gt;Modern Laboratory&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9f1c5f6ce38c7ab04f7731a5761123242877c7ef.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=093b2d8b89708d95d3aec264ab1adebf"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create a modern laboratory environment with this 3D asset pack. Modern Laboratory is centered around scientific and research themes, with elements and references covering chemistry, physics, optics, biology, viruses, bacteria, drugs, and other laboratory-related subjects.     HIGHLIGHTS      Laboratory – Modern laboratory environment  ⚗️ Chemistry – Chemistry-related laboratory theme   Biology – Bacteria and virus-related themes   Physics &amp;amp; Optics – Scientific research themes   Drugs – Drug-related laboratory elements   Science – General scientific environment   Alien – Suitable for alien-themed laboratory settings   Horror &amp;amp; Zombie – Horror and zombie-related themes   VR – Suitable for VR environments&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="oldindustry"&gt;&lt;a id="oldindustry" href="https://youtu.be/KyiyCfUe8No"&gt;Old Industry&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create an old industrial environment with Old Industry. This 3D environment pack combines industrial and urban themes with vegetation and nature, making it centered around old factories, mills, and industrial locations.     HIGHLIGHTS      Industry – Industrial environment  ️ Factory – Factory-focused setting  ⚙️ Mill – Industrial mill environment   Vegetation – Vegetation and plant elements   Nature – Natural elements within the environment  ️ Urban – Urban environment theme  ️ Urbex – Urban exploration theme  ☢️ Post-Apocalyptic – Post-apocalyptic setting&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dungeoncrawlergridcontroller"&gt;&lt;a id="dungeoncrawlergridcontroller" href="https://youtu.be/Sr1OOwZplvM"&gt;Dungeon Crawler Grid Controller&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A complete, easy to use grid-based first-person dungeon crawler controller in the style of Legend of Grimrock, Dungeon Master, &amp;amp; Wizardry. No scripting required.   Features:   - Real-time or turn-based movement   - Smooth movement or instant snapping to grid   - Supports inclines, declines, &amp;amp; crouching   - Free look camera   - Optional head bob   - Minimap   - Compass   - Surface system for footstep and barrier sounds   - Triggers &amp;amp; interaction with doors, levers, stairs to other scenes, etc.   - Works with Input System, legacy input manager, Rewired, etc.   - Supports Input System local multiplayer.   - Optional Pixel Crushers Save System integration   - Complete, well-documented C# source code   - All art shown in demo scene is included for use in your projects&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="loveandhate"&gt;&lt;a id="loveandhate" href="https://youtu.be/OezPY8v5eMg"&gt;Love/Hate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Create complex characters that react emotionally to what’s actually happening in the game. Love/Hate is a relationship &amp;amp; personality simulator that models characters’ feelings about each other using emotional states and value-based judgment of deeds, including actions done by the player. It uses powerful, customizable personality and emotional state models, and it tracks how different characters and groups (factions) feel about each other, allowing you to define a dynamic web of social ties among your characters. Characters witness deeds committed by others, judge them according to their own personality and relationships, remember them, and share memories realistically, allowing news of actions to spread organically. No scripting required.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ashmonstertruckphysics"&gt;&lt;a id="ashmonstertruckphysics" href="https://youtu.be/0RfpOohmJP0"&gt;Ash Monster Truck Physics&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt; Bring monster truck physics into your Unity project!    Ash Monster Truck Physics is a mobile-friendly tool designed to make setting up a Monster Truck straightforward. Simply provide references for the vehicle body and wheels and use the quick setup workflow to get your Monster Truck ready.     The system is suitable for Monster Truck-based games featuring jumps, flips, tricks, Monster Truck fights, or simple racing gameplay. The asset also includes the 15 Arcade Monster Trucks Pack.    ️ The code is designed to be easy to understand and modify, making it useful when you want to adjust the vehicle behavior around your own project requirements.    Get your Monster Truck ready and start building your arcade-style driving gameplay! &lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="arcadedamagesystem"&gt;&lt;a id="arcadedamagesystem" href="https://youtu.be/-9XoD3SnjpU"&gt;Arcade Damage System&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt; Add arcade-style damage effects to your Unity projects!    Arcade Damage System is a tool focused on mesh deformation through collision impacts. When an object is hit, its mesh can deform to create a visual damage effect.    ⚙️ The system provides settings for controlling deformation behavior, including the radius of influence, deformation intensity, smoothness, and deformation limits.     It also supports optional mesh collider updates after deformation, helping keep collision detection synchronized with the modified mesh.     Use it for vehicle damage or other objects where you want collision impacts to produce visible mesh deformation.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gaiaforunity6"&gt;&lt;a id="gaiaforunity6" href="https://youtu.be/HxT-qdDrAG8"&gt;Gaia for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build and shape your own worlds with Gaia for Unity 6! Create terrains, landscapes and environments using an intuitive world-building workflow designed for Unity. Sculpt terrain, work with heightmaps, populate your world with nature and explore tools for terrain, water, trees, grass and more. Gaia brings together procedural world-building features to help you move from an empty scene toward a complete environment.  Whether you're creating mountains, forests, open landscapes or other terrain-based scenes, Gaia provides tools to help shape and develop your Unity worlds. Compatible with Built-in, URP and HDRP workflows. ✨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="pegasus_flythroughsforunity6"&gt;&lt;a id="pegasus_flythroughsforunity6" href="https://youtu.be/z51JOh-GKBc"&gt;Pegasus - Flythroughs for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Bring your Unity scenes to life with Pegasus, a flythrough and camera animation tool designed for creating cinematic paths through your environments. Create camera routes using splines, control the movement and direction of your camera, and build flythroughs for terrains, interiors and mesh-based scenes.  Pegasus can also be used to move other objects along paths, making it useful for creating controlled movements through your scenes. With support for cinematic-style camera work and integration with Gaia, you can set up engaging environment flythroughs and capture the movement of your scene with greater control. ✨&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ambientsounds_interactivesoundscapesforunity6"&gt;&lt;a id="ambientsounds_interactivesoundscapesforunity6" href="https://youtu.be/Dop3R67wV7g"&gt;Ambient Sounds - Interactive Soundscapes for Unity 6&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Give your game world a more dynamic audio atmosphere with Ambient Sounds! Organize music and sound effects into Sequences and play them globally or within specific areas of your game world.  Create different soundscapes for different locations, blend between regions and make audio react to Events and Requirements. You can also synchronize multiple Sequences and manage your ambient audio setup through the Ambient Sounds Manager and Monitor windows.  The package also includes a library of professionally composed music and sound effects, giving you a collection of audio content to work with while building interactive soundscapes for your game.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="megastampbundle"&gt;&lt;a id="megastampbundle"&gt;Mega Stamp Bundle&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/cbbb24658ec7f9223649255e8db8158f9363a038.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=bacab883cf5506f0be3dfb98a11ab287"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;⛰️ Shape your Unity terrains with the Mega Stamp Bundle, a collection of 14 stamp packs containing 140 professionally designed heightmap stamps. Explore a variety of terrain shapes including canyons, mountains, craters, dunes, hills and valleys, and combine different stamps to create more complex landscapes.  The stamps can be used directly with Unity Terrain Tools, Gaia and other tools that support heightmap-based terrain stamps. Each pack contains 10 different stamps, giving you a broad selection of terrain forms to experiment with when sculpting your environments. ️&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
