;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completeobject-orientedjavacourse_fromconceptstoreal-worldimplemen"&gt;Complete Object-Oriented Java Course - From Concepts to Real-World Implementation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masterjavadevelopment_fromzerotoprofessionaldeveloper"&gt;Master Java Development - From Zero to Professional Developer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completetddcourse_javaunittestingwithmockitoframework"&gt;Complete TDD Course - Java Unit Testing with Mockito Framework&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#modernjava_masteringfeaturesfromjava8tojava25"&gt;Modern Java - Mastering Features from Java 8 to Java 25&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datastructuresandalgorithmsinjavaplus150leetcodeproblems"&gt;Data Structures &amp; Algorithms in Java + 150 Leetcode Problems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masteringjava_frombeginnertointermediate"&gt;Mastering Java - From Beginner to Intermediate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#javaprogrammingcertificationcourse"&gt;Java Programming Certification Course&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#kafkamicroserviceswithspringbootdockerkubernetesai"&gt;Kafka MicroServices with Spring Boot, Docker, Kubernetes, AI&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#designandimplementciandcdpipelinesusingjenkins_hands-on"&gt;Design &amp; Implement CI/CD Pipelines using Jenkins - Hands-On&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#springbootmicroservicesarchitecture_buildproduction-readyenterpris"&gt;Spring Boot Microservices Architecture - Build Production-Ready Enterprise Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#masterdatastructuresandalgorithms_problem-solvingwithjava"&gt;Master Data Structures and Algorithms - Problem-Solving with Java&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#javaoop_objectorientedprogrammingwithexercises"&gt;Java OOP: Objec