      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/62814b9904d97573c3ce7c7fe0d9ced719fe1152.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=fd026a6de26674e9568d0a0f15662b3d"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/0c95d1284bfa9b8689bec3bc4da0b3f4f7a0180f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=49e1efbf8c606a69c380812d4cc5e7ec"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Your imagination, running on your own computer.&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Ultimate AI Image Toolkit puts four AI image tools from Distinct AI on your own Windows computer, with no credits to buy. Generate images from a text prompt with Render FX. Edit and reimagine photos from plain-language instructions with Vision FX. Turn prompts or JPG and PNG files into clean, scalable SVG graphics with Vector FX. Add depth and detail to your photos with HDR FX, right inside supported Adobe, Corel, and Affinity software. Create as much as you want, wherever you work, and help support Optimist International Youth Programs Foundation with your purchase. &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt; &lt;strong style="color: #ef9741;"&gt; Must redeem your keys before November 2027.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $7 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#hdrfx"&gt;HDR FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#renderfx"&gt;Render FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#visionfx"&gt;Vision FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#vectorfx"&gt;Vector FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $7 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="hdrfx"&gt;&lt;a id="hdrfx"&gt;HDR FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/bf0c813a76c91420e5de453de856cbacefba9358.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=0fc82d86f30ec8acdab50d63be82b2a5"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;HDR FX is an AI-powered HDR enhancement plugin that adds depth, detail, and drama to your images, right inside the editing software you already use. HDR, or High Dynamic Range, pulls more detail, contrast, and intensity out of the light and dark areas of a photo. HDR FX makes it easy with precision sliders for intensity, detail, contrast, and color, plus 25 professionally designed presets like Glowing Sunrise, Saturated Sky, and Blue Hour to guide the look. A before-and-after slider lets you compare the original with the enhanced result in real time. Use it on landscapes, real estate photos, and product shots, and apply effects without leaving your workflow in supported Adobe, Corel, and Affinity applications. Requires a compatible host application.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt30"&gt;Pay $30 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="renderfx"&gt;&lt;a id="renderfx" href="https://youtu.be/-ihKIA23pro"&gt;Render FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/d3b1ebb410bb174e3436e6aade6ae656a6eff505.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ce76da1139328678a2be812172163393"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Render FX turns a text prompt into a finished image in seconds, running on your own computer with no credits to buy. Describe what you want, then shape and refine it, from photorealism to cinematic photography, portraits, illustration, anime, and ink sketching. Intuitive sliders control generation steps, denoising strength, detail strength, upscaling, and aspect ratio, so you can tune each result instead of starting over. Style presets guide the look, and the Model Hub lets you choose the AI model that fits the job. Use it for concept art, marketing visuals, product imagery, and social content.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="visionfx"&gt;&lt;a id="visionfx" href="https://youtu.be/UKywGLkjeDM"&gt;Vision FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/fe09d604e0583aa6c651115f2f23a899aa54f399.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6ace0ab5d52a2ae3303903b90fe52831"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Vision FX edits and reimagines your images from plain-language instructions. Describe the change, like replacing an object, fixing a detail, or adding something new, and Vision FX makes it while everything else stays exactly as it was. With supported models, Structure Guidance holds your composition in place while you change the style, material, or mood, and Style Reference pulls the color, lighting, and mood from a second image. Reimagine any photo with 20+ style presets, or generate up to 50 variations at once in Batch Mode and keep the strongest. It's a natural fit for product photography, e-commerce, real estate staging, and marketing visuals, in a clean, simple workspace.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="vectorfx"&gt;&lt;a id="vectorfx" href="https://youtu.be/PEStStJ-x4k"&gt;Vector FX&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/1a59b5f7767018f31af4812ad30a6fef55519ada.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=6ae3ad90701845b4dbc891dfcdf727a9"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root="1"&gt;Vector FX turns prompts and existing images into clean, editable SVG graphics in seconds. Describe what you want, or import a JPG or PNG and convert it to scalable vector art, then fine-tune detail, smoothness, color simplification, corner rounding, path coarseness, and node count with instant visual feedback. Choose from 15 style presets, including logos, illustration, cartoons, and pixel art, or generate up to 50 variations at once in Batch Mode. Export production-ready SVGs for logos, apparel, signage, packaging, and more, and open them in vector tools like CorelDRAW, Illustrator, and Affinity Designer.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
