y something to talk about.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hype builds before launch, not after. Enroll today!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildadswithhiggsfieldmarketingstudioai"&gt;&lt;a id="buildadswithhiggsfieldmarketingstudioai"&gt;Build Ads with Higgsfield Marketing Studio AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b2a5ce26187f848bb3834998d8ea481884b12ea4.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=49d9f4aefb78df03a30202b3a7491b8e"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Product shots and video ads without a photo studio. This video course works through Higgsfield Marketing Studio from first product shot to finished video ad.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;You’ll generate stills, edit them in layers, and make video ads from prompts and avatar models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Creating your first product shot in Marketing Studio.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Prototyping ads for non-physical products.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Editing ads with layer decomposition and other editing tools.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;► Making video ads from prompts and with avatar models.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;It closes with a full build: a salsa video ad from start to finish.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Lifetime access to all modules.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Certificate of Completion.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;✅ Source files included.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Your competitors are testing more creative than you. Start now!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="cinematographyandcameramovementwithhiggsfieldcinemastudioai"&gt;&lt;a id="cinematographyandcameramovementwithhiggsfieldcinemastudioai"&gt;Cinematography and Camera Movement with Higgsfield Cinema Studio AI &lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/9eb7e7f62aa9f91bbee7836413fb23f579fd7bd0.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ce4163eaf46b697e55e854eb504bed5b"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Camera movement is what makes footage feel