      <title>Data Engineering Masterclass</title>
      <author>Packt</author>
      <link>https://www.humblebundle.com//software/data-engineering-masterclass-software</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">03a56707a3a7581eecbe1fea6ba86097eb74c4f3</guid>
      <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;div&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e787519f83aa70b0fa1549ee2639cdd8ec708759.png?auto=compress,format&amp;h=340&amp;w=1200&amp;s=ce9d6d48a765f78693a9e134fcbb7d6a"&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/b1c879e060a10678cb7cd6961b2f5d8ec0232c6c.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=crop&amp;h=600&amp;w=1200&amp;s=413ce08b4ca374b1282f5e6fd5c4626d"&gt;&lt;h2&gt;A masterclass in data engineering advancement&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build comprehensive skills in databases, data analytics, and AI-driven data modeling through hands-on learning. Master SQL and MySQL fundamentals, advanced queries, joins, subqueries, CTEs, window functions, indexing, and performance optimization. Explore Neo4j, Cypher, Graph Data Science, vector databases, and embeddings to develop AI applications using semantic search, knowledge graphs, and Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG). Learn data modeling, ETL processes, Power BI, and AI tools like ChatGPT and Copilot. Apply your knowledge through practical projects involving data cleaning, analysis, database design, and optimization. Build a professional GitHub portfolio while gaining job-ready skills for real-world data management and AI applications. &lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;span style="color: #ef9741;"&gt;Keys expire. All titles should be redeemed before November 11, 2027.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#neo4j_cyphergdsgraphqlllmknowledgegraphsforrag"&gt;Neo4j: Cypher, GDS, GraphQL, LLM, Knowledge Graphs for RAG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#gettingstartedwithvectordatabasesandaiembeddings"&gt;Getting Started with Vector Databases and AI Embeddings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#sqlbootcamp_fromzerotojob-ready"&gt;SQL Bootcamp - From Zero to Job-Ready&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#real-worldsqlprojects_5hands-oncasestudies"&gt;Real-World SQL Projects - 5 Hands-On Case Studies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&g