te - Practical Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completedatabricksprojectongooglecloudgcp"&gt;The Complete Databricks Project on Google Cloud (GCP)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#completegcpdataengineeringproject_retailerdomain"&gt;The Complete GCP Data Engineering Project - Retailer Domain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#builddatawarehouseusingbigquery"&gt;Build Data Warehouse using BigQuery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dataengineeringvol2awsdataprocessing_sparkandkafka"&gt;Data Engineering Vol2 AWS Data Processing - Spark &amp; Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#dataengineeringonawsvol1_olapanddatawarehouse"&gt;Data Engineering on AWS Vol 1 - OLAP &amp; Data Warehouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datawarehousedatalakeanddatalakehouse_fundamentals"&gt;Data Warehouse, Data Lake &amp; Data Lakehouse - Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href="#datacloudconsultantdata360withreal-worldscenarios"&gt;Data Cloud Consultant (Data 360) with Real-World Scenarios&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h2 id="0"&gt;Pay $5 to unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="neo4j_cyphergdsgraphqlllmknowledgegraphsforrag"&gt;&lt;a id="neo4j_cyphergdsgraphqlllmknowledgegraphsforrag" href="https://youtu.be/onwH390w8B0"&gt;Neo4j: Cypher, GDS, GraphQL, LLM, Knowledge Graphs for RAG&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/c7b865d9ecebf557ef6a2cbcb421348fa5d6fc00.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=9317c472994cffbf3c36756423bf9c6f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore Neo4j fundamentals, Cypher queries, and Graph Data Science algorithms to unlock graph insights. Learn to integrate GraphQL APIs and build knowledge graphs with Large Language Models. This course equips you to apply Neo4j for advanced AI applications, including Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="gettingstartedwithvectordatabasesandaiembeddings"&gt;&lt;a id="gettingstartedwithvectordatabasesandaiembeddings" href="https://youtu.be/EzX6csQnNl0"&gt;Getting Started with Vector Databases and AI Embeddings&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the fascinating world of vectors and embeddings that make AI truly intelligent. This course introduces the fundamentals of vector databases and workflows, guiding you from raw data to real-world applications like semantic search, RAG, recommendation systems, anomaly detection, and visual search.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sqlbootcamp_fromzerotojob-ready"&gt;&lt;a id="sqlbootcamp_fromzerotojob-ready" href="https://youtu.be/KAspU_Nl-q4"&gt;SQL Bootcamp - From Zero to Job-Ready&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Are you looking to master SQL and MySQL for data analytics or database management? This SQL Bootcamp takes you from beginner to job-ready, with hands-on practice and project-based learning. Perfect for anyone eager to learn SQL and build real-world skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="real-worldsqlprojects_5hands-oncasestudies"&gt;&lt;a id="real-worldsqlprojects_5hands-oncasestudies" href="https://youtu.be/YAyojb8etMM"&gt;Real-World SQL Projects - 5 Hands-On Case Studies&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This hands-on course covers five real-world SQL projects, from data cleaning to analysis. Learn how to build optimized SQL queries and create a professional portfolio to showcase on GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="ai-drivendatamodelingusingchatgptandcopilot"&gt;&lt;a id="ai-drivendatamodelingusingchatgptandcopilot" href="https://youtu.be/hHbHLadLtbg"&gt;AI-Driven Data Modeling Using ChatGPT and Copilot&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master AI-driven data modeling with ChatGPT and Copilot in this comprehensive course. Learn everything from data modeling fundamentals to advanced ETL processes, and gain hands-on experience with Power BI. Prepare to harness AI for real-world data modeling challenges.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="masteringadvancedsql"&gt;&lt;a id="masteringadvancedsql" href="https://youtu.be/C5-3erX2ad0"&gt;Mastering Advanced SQL&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Learn to work with conditional logic, subqueries, CTEs, ranking functions, window frames, and row comparisons. Apply these techniques in a practical capstone project involving data import, cleaning, and exploration.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="sqlforbeginners_learnsqlwithhands-onprojectsandexercises"&gt;&lt;a id="sqlforbeginners_learnsqlwithhands-onprojectsandexercises" href="https://youtu.be/qEMkqvEDFs0"&gt;SQL for Beginners - Learn SQL with Hands-On Projects &amp; Exercises&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a strong SQL foundation with MySQL through guided lessons, coding exercises, and practical projects. Learn database design, querying, joins, indexing, and performance optimization while developing real-world database skills.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt12"&gt;Pay $12 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="microsoftfabric_fundamentalsandpowerbiworkflow"&gt;&lt;a id="microsoftfabric_fundamentalsandpowerbiworkflow" href="https://youtu.be/PU5yzQ8_btc"&gt;Microsoft Fabric: Fundamentals and Power BI Workflow&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/6ab2a44249f78508e74e2a39cdc9ad80b2f24bb6.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=46d907f430e6a688c631e65360405c8c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Dive into Microsoft Fabric with this comprehensive course covering essential tools, techniques, and workflows for seamless integration with Power BI. From basic configurations to advanced report creation, this course equips you with the skills to manage data and unlock insights. Learn by hands-on examples and real-world use cases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="buildingamoderndatacatalogwithmicrosoftpurview"&gt;&lt;a id="buildingamoderndatacatalogwithmicrosoftpurview" href="https://youtu.be/Dzxd9yZGoc4"&gt;Building a Modern Data Catalog with Microsoft Purview&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course teaches you how to build a modern data catalog using Microsoft Purview. You'll learn to register data sources, create data products, manage data quality, and enable lineage across Azure services. Gain practical skills to support data governance at scale.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="databricks_dataanalystassociate_10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="databricks_dataanalystassociate_10practiceexams" href="https://youtu.be/koO2XtoUNSY"&gt;Databricks Certified Data Analyst Associate Exam Prep&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/e852d612c227b480e9971232442d2547f5830758.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=ec47010f5a74fdfb124e876fbf0beedd"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course offers comprehensive preparation for the Databricks Certified Data Analyst Associate exam. Learn how to work with Databricks, SQL, Delta Lake, Unity Catalog, and more, with hands-on labs and real-world examples to ensure exam readiness.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="genaidataengineeringandragsystems"&gt;&lt;a id="genaidataengineeringandragsystems" href="https://youtu.be/5FheiF68z64"&gt;GenAI Data Engineering and RAG Systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build practical RAG system skills by transforming enterprise documents into AI-ready data, designing knowledge bases, optimizing retrieval, and deploying support applications.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="azurefabricdataengineercertdp-700pluspracticeqns"&gt;&lt;a id="azurefabricdataengineercertdp-700pluspracticeqns" href="https://youtu.be/gKyWVDc9Khs"&gt;Azure Fabric Data Engineer CERT (DP-700) + PRACTICE QNS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build Microsoft Fabric data engineering skills while preparing for the DP-700 certification through practical coverage of OneLake, Data Factory, Fabric Warehouse, Real-Time Intelligence, architecture, security, and practice questions.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="moderndataarchitectureonazure"&gt;&lt;a id="moderndataarchitectureonazure" href="https://youtu.be/6Im5x54UKFE"&gt;Modern Data Architectures&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/65433e18dbcb1cac0d9152eed2175cce67398141.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=d9c18797551afff52965ac66ab065a1c"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explore the principles, components, advantages, and challenges of leading data architecture patterns. Develop a practical framework for comparing Lambda, Kappa, Medallion, Data Mesh, and Data Fabric, then selecting an approach suited to scalability, governance, security, and data flow needs.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="mysqlpostgresqlandmongodbdatabasedesignmasterclass"&gt;&lt;a id="mysqlpostgresqlandmongodbdatabasedesignmasterclass" href="https://youtu.be/OFkBhLhkXKs"&gt;MySQL, PostgreSQL and MongoDB Database Design Masterclass&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;A three-platform database program covering relational and document-based design. Learners configure tools, model data, build queries, manage relationships, and perform essential SQL and MongoDB operations.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datamesh_architectureprinciplesandimplementation"&gt;&lt;a id="datamesh_architectureprinciplesandimplementation" href="https://youtu.be/npQeANs5p-4"&gt;Data Mesh - Architecture, Principles &amp; Implementation&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a clear architectural and organizational understanding of Data Mesh. The course explains why centralized approaches stall, how domain ownership and data products work, and how the four principles guide practical implementation across modern data ecosystems.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h2 id="bt18"&gt;Pay $18 or more to also unlock!&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h3 id="dataengineeringonaws_thecompletetraining"&gt;&lt;a id="dataengineeringonaws_thecompletetraining" href="https://youtu.be/mmcjRQW2R30"&gt;Data Engineering on AWS - The Complete Training&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This comprehensive training walks you through the core of data engineering using AWS. Learn how to catalog, process, stream, query, and visualize big data using state-of-the-art AWS services. Gain hands-on expertise in building robust data pipelines with modern cloud architecture.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="databricks_dataengineerassociate_10practiceexams"&gt;&lt;a id="databricks_dataengineerassociate_10practiceexams" href="https://youtu.be/kJ_E73mcwjI"&gt;Databricks Certified Data Engineer Associate - Practical Guide&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img src="https://hb.imgix.net/efe29288f42fce69fee13936a113834a6aeccc3f.jpg?auto=compress,format&amp;fit=clip&amp;h=350&amp;w=600&amp;s=8d811a10b061a1e311beef8347d3129f"&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course covers all essential Databricks concepts for aspiring data engineers, including Apache Spark fundamentals, Delta Lake, performance optimization, and data pipeline creation. With real-world demonstrations, you will gain practical experience in deploying and orchestrating data engineering workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="completedatabricksprojectongooglecloudgcp"&gt;&lt;a id="completedatabricksprojectongooglecloudgcp" href="https://youtu.be/tPXQ5CaYkZ0"&gt;The Complete Databricks Project on Google Cloud (GCP)&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course teaches you to set up and manage Databricks on Google Cloud, covering everything from account setup to production workflows. Learn to build dynamic schemas, transform data with bronze, silver, and gold tables, and automate pipelines using Git and orchestration tools for real-world data engineering projects.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="completegcpdataengineeringproject_retailerdomain"&gt;&lt;a id="completegcpdataengineeringproject_retailerdomain" href="https://youtu.be/cp3Zn2IIgBI"&gt;The Complete GCP Data Engineering Project - Retailer Domain&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This course guides you through creating an end-to-end GCP data engineering pipeline. Master BigQuery layering, PySpark processing, and Airflow orchestration with hands-on exercises. Apply CI/CD and cloud best practices for real-world data workflows.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="builddatawarehouseusingbigquery"&gt;&lt;a id="builddatawarehouseusingbigquery" href="https://youtu.be/3cD-rOrA4s8"&gt;Build Data Warehouse using BigQuery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gain practical BigQuery skills for setting up datasets, creating tables through the UI, SQL, and Python, building ETL workflows, and writing analytical queries for enterprise-scale data management.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dataengineeringvol2awsdataprocessing_sparkandkafka"&gt;&lt;a id="dataengineeringvol2awsdataprocessing_sparkandkafka" href="https://youtu.be/6nIicm9oqDs"&gt;Data Engineering Vol2 AWS Data Processing - Spark &amp; Kafka&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Gain practical data processing skills with Spark, Kafka, AWS EMR, MSK, S3, Iceberg, Databricks, and streaming workloads through hands-on projects using large datasets and real-world data engineering scenarios.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="dataengineeringonawsvol1_olapanddatawarehouse"&gt;&lt;a id="dataengineeringonawsvol1_olapanddatawarehouse" href="https://youtu.be/acZaBT8RkKY"&gt;Data Engineering on AWS Vol 1 - OLAP &amp; Data Warehouse&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Develop AWS data engineering skills for the warehouse and analytics layer, including S3, Redshift, Athena, Hive, Glue Data Catalog, Lake Formation, data modeling, security, and query performance tuning.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datawarehousedatalakeanddatalakehouse_fundamentals"&gt;&lt;a id="datawarehousedatalakeanddatalakehouse_fundamentals" href="https://youtu.be/gyrjmkahc34"&gt;Data Warehouse, Data Lake &amp; Data Lakehouse - Fundamentals&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Build a clear foundation in modern data platform architecture. Explore databases, OLTP and OLAP, ETL and ELT, data warehouses, data lakes, and lakehouses, then compare their strengths, challenges, technologies, and best-fit enterprise use cases.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3 id="datacloudconsultantdata360withreal-worldscenarios"&gt;&lt;a id="datacloudconsultantdata360withreal-worldscenarios" href="https://youtu.be/OksV8swzQ2A"&gt;Data Cloud Consultant (Data 360) with Real-World Scenarios&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;img&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;Master Salesforce Data Cloud (Data 360) through real-world enterprise scenarios. Learn data ingestion, modeling, governance, identity resolution, segmentation, activation, and AI-powered capabilities like RAG and Document AI. Build end-to-end customer data solutions confidently.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
